Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.47,0:01:00.35,Title,0,0,0,0,,《夺宝奇兵5：命运转盘》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.97,0:04:11.18,Note,0,0,0,0,,（美国炸弹）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.04,0:23:48.01,Note,0,0,0,0,,（玛莉安·瑞文伍 小亨利·华顿·琼斯 无异议分居）
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.99,0:26:59.32,Note,0,0,0,0,,（退休快乐）
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.92,1:13:49.19,Note,0,0,0,0,,（丹吉尔）
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.05,1:13:54.11,Note,0,0,0,0,,（卡萨布兰加）
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.03,1:14:01.70,Note,0,0,0,0,,（意大利）
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.70,1:14:03.41,Note,0,0,0,0,,（希腊）
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.41,1:14:06.98,Note,0,0,0,0,,（雅典）
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.38,1:37:09.46,Note,0,0,0,0,,（西西里 叙拉古）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.84,0:00:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,站起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On your feet!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.86,0:01:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是美国人 上校{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An American, Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.57,0:01:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在大门假装是军官{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was at the gate, impersonating an officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.08,0:01:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.83,0:01:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,间谍 你一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spy, you were alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.00,0:01:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢一个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like to be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.71,0:01:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来做什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you come here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.26,0:01:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有不少好东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a lot of nice stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.88,0:01:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,别人的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other people's stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.93,0:01:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,赢家通吃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"To the victor belongs the spoils."
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.27,0:01:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,赢家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"To the victor"?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.43,0:01:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,柏林已成废墟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Berlin's in rubble.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.06,0:01:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳粹元首躲起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Führer's in hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.94,0:01:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们输了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.57,0:01:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,带他到楼上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.61,0:01:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.78,0:01:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.74,0:02:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, wait a second. Guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.99,0:02:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,请等一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A moment. Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.99,0:02:04.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,停 我得跟指挥官谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop! I must speak to the commander.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.87,0:02:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,上校 我找到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel. I found it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.83,0:02:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,听他的 打开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do as he says. Open it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.60,0:02:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,朗基努斯之枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Lance of Long in us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.14,0:02:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,沾染基督之血的长矛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blade that drew Christ's blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.31,0:02:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Holy Lance.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.87,0:02:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,加强维安 这是元首在找的宝物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Double the guard. This is the prize the Führer seeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.20,0:02:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,上校 我们谈一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel, we need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.37,0:02:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没空 博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No time, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.66,0:02:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,往柏林的火车在等你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The train to Berlin is waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.42,0:02:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,搜索树林{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Search the woods!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.67,0:02:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,带狗去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.54,0:02:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想那间谍是一个人吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think that spy was alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.55,0:02:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,快…出发{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go! Go! We're moving out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.34,0:02:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,动作快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the double!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.41,0:03:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来他们丢下你们了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like they're leaving without you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.83,0:03:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,说说你的来历 否则没命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell us your story, or die.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.75,0:03:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,来历{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Story.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.96,0:03:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.00,0:03:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.80,0:03:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it all started…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.96,0:03:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,在很久很久以前 有个村子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}once upon a time, when this village…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.34,0:03:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群愚蠢的蓝眼男孩决定一起加入{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of stupid blue-eyed boys decided to join hands together…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.60,0:03:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,追随名叫阿道夫的吹笛手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and follow this sweaty little pied piper named Adolf…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.21,0:04:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.91,0:05:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人跟那美国佬一伙的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This man was with the American.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.75,0:05:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是美国背包{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the American's bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.71,0:05:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have I done?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.26,0:05:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,带他到我的车厢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring him to my carriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.47,0:05:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 这是元首的特殊文物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful. This is the Führer's special relic!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.80,0:06:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay seated.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.76,0:06:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.22,0:06:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是赏鸟人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are a birdwatcher?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.81,0:06:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 因为轰炸的关系{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Because of the bombing,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.98,0:06:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,鹡鸰的飞行路线完全改变{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the wagtails are following a completely different trajectory.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.57,0:06:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们抓到你的同伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We caught your accomplice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.49,0:06:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个美国佬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The American.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.64,0:07:56.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,完了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.79,0:08:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.36,0:08:54.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还活着是有原因的 赏鸟人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's one reason you're still alive, birdwatcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.62,0:08:59.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁派你来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who sent you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.33,0:09:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么任务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was your mission?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.66,0:09:02.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 上校 我求你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Colonel, no. I beg you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.83,0:09:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫贝索萧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Basil Shaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.38,0:09:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是牛津大学教授{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a professor at Oxford.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.21,0:09:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,考古学家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An archeologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.43,0:09:18.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.72,0:09:24.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.73,0:09:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有话跟上校说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must speak to the Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.52,0:09:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是急事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's urgent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.69,0:09:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有女儿 我求你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a daughter. I beg you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.24,0:09:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证你再也见不到孩子 萧先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guarantee you will never see your child again, Mr. Shaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.28,0:09:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你说明你的同伙怎么有这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you explain why your accomplice had this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.81,0:10:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们听说能在堡垒找到朗基努斯之枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were told that the Lance of Long in us could be found at the fortress.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.86,0:10:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在找它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were looking for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.61,0:10:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.36,0:10:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为它的魔力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because of its power?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.53,0:10:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,它没有魔力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has no power.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.87,0:10:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和我朋友想抢救历史文物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friend and I were trying to save history.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.12,0:10:29.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须跟上校谈{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must speak with the Colonel.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.88,0:10:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟圣枪有关{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about the Lance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.67,0:11:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只看了一下子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only had a moment to look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.26,0:11:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我的专长是物理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, my training is in physics,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.47,0:11:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天 有屁快放{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For God's sake, spit it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.52,0:11:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那把圣枪…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Lance…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.94,0:11:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,冒牌货{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.27,0:11:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,是冒牌货{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.69,0:11:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,冒牌货{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A fake?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.69,0:11:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪头是合金{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The blade is an alloy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.78,0:11:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有50年历史{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifty years old,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.15,0:11:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,雕刻是新的 它是复制品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the engravings recent. It's a replica.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.49,0:11:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们死定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.29,0:11:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,12世纪 13世纪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twelfth century. Thirteenth century.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.29,0:11:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉美西斯二世{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ramesses II.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.21,0:11:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些都不是假的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of this stuff is fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.80,0:11:58.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得拦下这列火车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta stop this train.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.71,0:12:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,火车上还有另一件文物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is another relic on this train.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.30,0:12:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,拥有真正的魔力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One with real power.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.93,0:12:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.26,0:12:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,安提基瑟拉仪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Antikythera.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.89,0:12:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,安提基瑟拉仪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Antikythera?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.81,0:12:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再讲那个老轮盘了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough about that old dial!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.23,0:12:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,上校 元首输掉战争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonel, the Führer has lost the war…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.65,0:12:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,也失心疯了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and his mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.52,0:12:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,容我说明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.49,0:12:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,安提基瑟拉仪的力量不在超自然{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Antikythera's power is not supernatural.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.49,0:12:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是数学{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is mathematics.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.08,0:12:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,能驾驭它的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever harnesses it…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.66,0:12:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会成为国王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}will not be King…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.92,0:12:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是皇帝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}nor Emperor…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.29,0:12:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,或元首{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}or Führer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.21,0:12:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会成为上帝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will be God.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.11,0:13:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,太多纳粹了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too many Nazis.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.70,0:13:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你建议我们该怎么跟他说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how do you propose we tell him this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.99,0:13:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的元首{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My Führer,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.37,0:13:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,很遗憾圣枪是假的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry the Lance of Christ is fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.66,0:13:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过您看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But here is…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.33,0:13:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个缺一半的东西是您没听过的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}half of something you've never heard of.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.59,0:13:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.96,0:13:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见过希特勒吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}have you ever met Hitler?!!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.05,0:13:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,车上有破坏分子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A saboteur aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.34,0:13:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,希特勒的圣枪不见了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Hitler's Lance is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.89,0:14:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.89,0:14:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里干嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.48,0:14:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么搞的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.99,0:14:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.36,0:14:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,老贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baz?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.74,0:14:28.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还活着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.24,0:14:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So far.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.12,0:14:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是叫你待在树林里吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I told you to stay in the woods, Baz.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.58,0:14:37.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友生死交关 怎么能躲在树篱里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What sort of a man hides in a hedge while his friend is facing death?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.76,0:14:54.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人掠夺世界半数古董{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This lot are carting off half the world's antiquities.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.39,0:14:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想阻止他们 但现在得先救你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was gonna stop 'em, but now I've gotta rescue you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.35,0:15:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你至少找到圣枪了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you at least find the Lance?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.23,0:15:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 至少 - 找到了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "At least"? - Well, have you got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.56,0:15:03.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是假的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.57,0:15:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.36,0:15:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,复制品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A reproduction.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.24,0:15:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.49,0:15:15.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indy?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.75,0:15:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,安提基瑟拉仪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Antikythera.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.01,0:15:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿基米德的轮盘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Archimedes' Dial.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.22,0:15:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,带走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.94,0:15:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 老贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up, Baz.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.20,0:15:54.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.53,0:15:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.30,0:16:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来 老贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up, Baz.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.05,0:16:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.93,0:16:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,走向枪林弹雨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Towards the gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.39,0:16:16.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,远离纳粹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Away from the Nazis!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.10,0:16:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些人就是纳粹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are Nazis!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.60,0:16:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down! Down! Down!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.86,0:17:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,走这边 快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.49,0:17:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.57,0:17:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想躺下来休息吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna stop for a little lie-down?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.49,0:17:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们拿走安提基瑟拉仪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have the Antikythera!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.29,0:17:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.36,0:17:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,隧道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tunnel!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.00,0:18:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住你了 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got you! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.08,0:18:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.38,0:18:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.64,0:19:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,射他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.98,0:19:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是射我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.11,0:19:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.67,0:19:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,赢家通吃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the victor go the spoils.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.49,0:20:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪放下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop the gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.96,0:20:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,安提基瑟拉仪给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the Antikythera.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.64,0:20:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.94,0:20:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.86,0:20:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这边 - 他们听不见 老贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here! - They can't hear you, Baz.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.74,0:20:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得跳车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta jump!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.28,0:20:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我膝盖不好怎么办{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about my dicky knee?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.37,0:20:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,老贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baz!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.50,0:20:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,老贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baz!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.34,0:20:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,老贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baz!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.71,0:21:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 印第 - 老贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Indy! - Baz!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.93,0:21:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Move! Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.93,0:21:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,两手空空回家有点糗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bit rum to go home empty-handed after all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.39,0:21:15.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,两手空空{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Empty-handed"?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.77,0:21:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.90,0:21:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿基米德的轮盘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Archimedes' Dial.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.19,0:21:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一半{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, half of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.40,0:21:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 老贝 我们回家去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Baz. Let's get home.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.97,0:22:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,赖瑞 小声点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Larry! Turn it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.64,0:22:34.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,小声一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.06,0:22:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 赖瑞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Larry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.62,0:22:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,赖瑞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Larry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.12,0:22:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,赖瑞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Larry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.12,0:22:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 琼斯先生 - 赖瑞呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi, Mr. Jones. - Where's Larry?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.04,0:22:58.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is this guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.96,0:23:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,隔壁的老头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the old guy next door.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.25,0:23:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,赖瑞 现在早上8点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Larry, it's 8:00 in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.04,0:23:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在早上8点 - 我们讲过了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "It's 8:00 in the morning." - We talked about this, Larry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.59,0:23:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 不过那是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but that was…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.71,0:23:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 平日 - 今天也是平日 赖瑞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- a workday, Mr. Jones. - This is a workday too, Larry!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.55,0:23:10.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,看一下新闻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn on the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.84,0:23:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天登月日 琼斯先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's moon day, Mr. Jones.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.22,0:23:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,登月日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moon day?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.99,0:24:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.42,0:24:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们只要记住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you really need to remember…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.42,0:24:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这时期的亚述陶器…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that Assyrian ceramics of this period are characterized…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.05,0:24:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,都有复杂的蓝线图案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}by this complex blue-line pattern.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.30,0:24:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.39,0:24:37.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我指定你们今天要看温福的书{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I assigned pages 131 through 171…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.93,0:24:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,第131到171页{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in Winford for today.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.47,0:24:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人看了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody do the reading?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.69,0:24:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.32,0:24:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个会考哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gosh, this is on the test.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.57,0:24:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.95,0:24:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我直接讲给你们听{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess I'll spoon-feed it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.83,0:24:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,公元前213年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In 213 BC…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.62,0:25:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,马塞卢斯率领罗马军队{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roman forces led by Marcellus…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.79,0:25:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,包围叙拉古城{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}laid siege to the city of Syracuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.79,0:25:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,叙拉古耶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Syracuse."
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.92,0:25:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是纽约州的那个 谭雅{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the Syracuse in New York, Tonya.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.67,0:25:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,在西西里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one in Sicily.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.84,0:25:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,在捍卫这座城市的人当中{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amongst the defenders of the city…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.55,0:25:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个知名的居民 他是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}was its most famous resident, who was…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.89,0:25:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 期末考会考{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, guys. This is on the final.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.52,0:25:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿基米德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Archimedes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.77,0:25:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿基米德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Archimedes.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.98,0:25:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿基米德 他是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Archimedes, who was a…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.48,0:25:29.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,数学家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A mathematician.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.94,0:25:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,数学家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A mathematician.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.11,0:25:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,除此之外 也是发明家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But more than that, an inventor…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.86,0:25:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰出的工程师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a brilliant engineer…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.53,0:25:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想办法将地中海的太阳能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}who conceived of a way to harness the energy of the Mediterranean sun…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.04,0:25:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,集中在凹面镜上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}on concave mirrors and focus it…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.91,0:25:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,借以攻击罗马战舰 使它们着火{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}on attacking Roman warships and set them on fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.75,0:25:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他设计出庞大的铁爪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who devised giant iron claws…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.38,0:25:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,在海上抓敌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that could snatch hostiles from the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.55,0:25:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎么知道那真的发生过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how do we know it really happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.56,0:26:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些发明有没有无可辩驳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What physical, irrefutable archeological evidence…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.73,0:26:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 确切的考古证据 - 安提基瑟拉仪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- is there of these inventions? - The Antikythera.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.61,0:26:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安提基瑟拉仪 - 那只是开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The Antikythera. - For starters.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.77,0:26:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们来了 在市区{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're here! They're downtown!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.74,0:26:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,太空人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The astronauts.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.24,0:26:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上将有250万人…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Giant parade this morning will be seen…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.91,0:26:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,在人行道上观赏这场大游行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}by about two and a half million people lining the sidewalks…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.91,0:26:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's coming. He's come. See?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.46,0:26:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, here he comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.96,0:26:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛋糕藏起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hide the cake.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.59,0:26:33.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 惊喜 - 惊喜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Surprise. - Surprise!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.80,0:26:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,十几年来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For over a decade now…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.30,0:26:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼斯博士一直在亨特学院认真奉献{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}our colleague Dr. Jones has been a loyal servant of Hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.06,0:26:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,谨以这纪念品表达谢意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A token of our gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.98,0:26:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.32,0:27:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢大家容忍我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for putting up with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.51,0:27:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,送你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.93,0:27:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,太空人阿姆斯壮 科林斯与艾德林{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Astronauts Neil Armstrong, Mike Collins, and Buzz Aldrin…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.39,0:27:30.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,将无法避开镁光灯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}will not be able to avoid the spotlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.77,0:27:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,东部夏令时间上午11点 为表敬意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}At 11:00 a.m. Eastern Daylight Time, a grateful nation will pay homage…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.40,0:27:37.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽约与芝加哥将举行纸带游行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a ticker-tape parade through New York and Chicago…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.19,0:27:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,高潮是洛杉矶的晚宴…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}climaxed by a dinner in Los Angeles…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.99,0:27:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,古人会怎么说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would the ancients say?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.66,0:27:42.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,尼尔 巴兹和麦克…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neil, Buzz, and Mike…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.62,0:27:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们知道我们登陆月球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they knew we walked on the moon?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.24,0:27:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我这个古人的角度来看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speaking as an ancient…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.33,0:27:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,上月球就像去赌城雷诺{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}going to the moon is like going to Reno.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.87,0:27:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸟不生蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Middle of nowhere…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.38,0:27:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,却没有21点可玩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and no blackjack.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.88,0:27:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不认得我了吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't recognize me, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.84,0:28:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎样 我道歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever I did, I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.84,0:28:02.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是海伦娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Helena.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.43,0:28:05.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,海伦娜·萧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helena Shaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.39,0:28:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,袋熊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wombat?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.73,0:28:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好久没人这样叫我了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, I haven't heard that in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.06,0:28:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你长高了 - 对啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got tall. - I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.81,0:28:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fair to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.23,0:28:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在庆祝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm celebrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.44,0:28:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要退休了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm retiring.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.15,0:28:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那该喝什么呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. Well, in that case, what are we drinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.20,0:28:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,史密兹先生的客房服务{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Room service for Mr. Schmidt.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.34,0:28:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,收起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put that away.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.47,0:28:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在问你脚踝怎么受伤的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was asking how you broke your ankle.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.22,0:28:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不关你的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.18,0:28:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,您是史密兹先生吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you Mr. Schmidt?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.27,0:28:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,史密兹博士 他在里面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Doctor" Schmidt. He's in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.56,0:28:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不吃摆在轮子上的东西 放在桌上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he don't eat anything on wheels, so put it on a table.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.81,0:28:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,小时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was a little boy…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.61,0:28:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我常梦想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always imagined…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.94,0:29:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一天人类能在月球上漫步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that one day man would walk on the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.20,0:29:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And by golly…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.95,0:29:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,外面庆祝活动好热闹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite a celebration out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.08,0:29:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你服务的这个人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man you're servin'…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.71,0:29:19.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是他让太空人上月球的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's the one who put those astronauts on the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.17,0:29:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他建造他们搭的火箭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Built the rockets they rode in.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.63,0:29:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭喜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.34,0:29:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你哪里人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you from?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.26,0:29:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,布朗克斯 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Bronx, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.22,0:29:28.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我是说你祖先哪来的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. I mean originally, your people.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.51,0:29:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.98,0:29:35.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在洋基球场旁出生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was born by Yankee Stadium, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.27,0:29:40.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,为国出征过吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you fought for your country?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.07,0:29:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,第320营{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}320th Battalion.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.36,0:29:45.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,用防空气球阻止战机轰炸诺曼底{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set up balloons to stop the planes bombing Normandy.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.54,0:29:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢你们的胜利吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And are you enjoying your victory?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.42,0:30:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有其他吩咐吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will there be anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.01,0:30:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们战争没打赢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't win the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.80,0:30:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是希特勒输了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hitler lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.43,0:30:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.56,0:30:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的探员 她发现了萧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My field agent, she found Shaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.23,0:30:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm comin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.61,0:30:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 华克{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, Hauke.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.95,0:30:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are we here?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.28,0:30:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,牛津 花园里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oxford. In the garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.99,0:30:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他独树一格{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was an original.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.79,0:30:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚毕业{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just graduated.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.37,0:30:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,考古学{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Archeology.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.46,0:30:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,考古学 哇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Archeology. Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.63,0:30:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,有其父必有其女{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apple didn't fall far.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.42,0:30:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要攻读博士学位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, now I'm researching a doctorate.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.26,0:30:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,研究什么主题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your subject?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.05,0:30:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿基米德轮盘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Archimedes Dial.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.72,0:30:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,安提基瑟拉仪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Antikythera.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.10,0:30:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对它了解多少{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you know about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.98,0:30:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, for starters…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.48,0:31:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,海绵潜水夫1902年在希腊外海{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in 1902, Greek sponge divers found a wrecked Roman warship…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.07,0:31:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现一艘罗马战舰 庞然大物{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}huge, off the coast of Greece.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.03,0:31:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,用蜡密封起来的甲板底下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Below deck, sealed in wax…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.90,0:31:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一台像时钟的机器{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}was a clock-like mechanism…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.61,0:31:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,作工精细 用途不明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}finely tooled, purpose unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.78,0:31:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,有千年没出现过复杂度能匹敌的装置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing approximating its complexity appears in the world for 1, 000 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.70,0:31:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有做功课哦 - 不是我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You've done your homework. - Well, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.00,0:31:21.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸有好多日志 大量笔记{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad. He had all these journals, reams of notes about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.17,0:31:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一生着迷不已{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was obsessed till the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.67,0:31:28.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说你在纳粹的掠夺列车上发现它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told me you found it on a Nazi plunder train.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.30,0:31:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后掉在法国阿尔卑斯山的河里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then lost it in a river in the French Alps.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.23,0:31:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是很久以前的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that was a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.52,0:31:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是半个轮盘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it was only half the Dial.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.14,0:31:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿基米德… - 阿基米德拆成两半{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Archimedes… - Archimedes broke the Dial in two…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.85,0:31:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把它拆开 - 然后藏起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …disassembled it. - …and then hid…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.98,0:31:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,以免叙拉古被包围时让罗马人发现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the two halves from the Romans during the siege of Syracuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.15,0:31:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 你看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.49,0:31:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不记得上次我见到你吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't remember the last time I saw you, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.91,0:31:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember what?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.28,0:31:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是阿尔卑斯山{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are the Alps.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.91,0:31:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.41,0:31:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你列车走的路线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is the route that your train took…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.25,0:31:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 1944年从纳粹据点出发 - 对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- from the Nazi stronghold in '44. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.54,0:32:01.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,它经过这个隘口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It went through this mountain pass…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.54,0:32:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后到了这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.17,0:32:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是途中唯一一条河 - 对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Here, it's the only river on the route. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.55,0:32:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一座桥下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Under a bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.80,0:32:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,它一定在那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's down there. It's got to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.17,0:32:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 只有我们知道 - 我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And nobody knows except us. - "Us"?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.05,0:32:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I mean, you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.72,0:32:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我 对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And me. So, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.64,0:32:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们 - 我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Us. - Us.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.27,0:32:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底打什么主意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what were you thinking exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.23,0:32:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that maybe…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.15,0:32:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以去那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we could go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.86,0:32:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.07,0:32:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.07,0:32:30.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我就…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'd become…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.57,0:32:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,出名了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.78,0:32:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是出名{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well, not famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.12,0:32:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,声誉卓著 受尊敬{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Renowned. Feted.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.54,0:32:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,受尊敬的考古学家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A feted archeologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.50,0:32:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是你最后的一大成就{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you, a final triumph!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.41,0:32:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第安纳·琼斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indiana Jones!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.58,0:32:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,大获成功 重出江湖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out with a bang! Back in the saddle!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.59,0:32:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不心动吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not selling this, am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.51,0:32:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,袋熊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wombat…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.80,0:32:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何要追求{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}why are you chasing the thing…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.43,0:32:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你老爸逼疯的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that drove your father crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.48,0:33:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.25,0:33:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.25,0:33:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,游行快开始了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parade's comin' soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.42,0:33:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么发现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what we got?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.01,0:33:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在里面 跟一个老头在三楼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's in there, third floor, with an old guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.55,0:33:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是谁 俄国人吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is he, a Russian?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.89,0:33:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个教授 亨利·琼斯博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, a professor. Dr. Henry Jones.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.01,0:33:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷柏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Klaber!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.35,0:33:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷柏 回来 你不是探员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Klaber, get back here! You're not an agent!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.81,0:33:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 快去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddammit! Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.06,0:33:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来请求支援 调琼斯的档案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get support up here and pull a file on Jones.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.29,0:34:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.70,0:34:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝索迷上了这个德国理论{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Basil became obsessed by this German theory.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.33,0:34:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是猜测{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Conjecture, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.25,0:34:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿基米德发现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Archimedes had figured out…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.71,0:34:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,月球和行星的运动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the movements of the moon and planets…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.84,0:34:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不完美{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}weren't perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.30,0:35:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们的自转呈现不规则{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were irregularities in their rotations.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.97,0:35:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他认为这些不规则或许…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He thought these irregularities might…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.44,0:35:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,能解释温度和潮汐的变动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}explain fluctuations in temperature, tides.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.94,0:35:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至风暴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Storms, even.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.36,0:35:17.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他打算建造一个预测装置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, he set about building a device to predict them.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.07,0:35:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果他发现一个方法能预测更大的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then, he stumbled upon a method to predict even larger…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.04,0:35:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,扰动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}disturbances.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.54,0:35:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,更大的扰动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Larger disturbances?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.79,0:35:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲认为这玩意能…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father thought this thing could…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.71,0:35:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,预测时间的裂缝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}predict fissures in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.98,0:35:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,华克 如果你不…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hauke, if you don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.90,0:35:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到他们了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.66,0:36:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.79,0:36:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在找…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you looking for…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.04,0:36:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼斯博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Jones?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.00,0:36:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要帮忙吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.88,0:36:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用 谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.92,0:36:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是例行调查{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a routine investigation, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.72,0:36:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是警察吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you the police?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.51,0:36:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一下子就好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll just be a few moments.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.89,0:36:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 普林顿教授 - 小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Professor Plimpton. - Ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.89,0:36:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 普林顿教授 - 小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Professor Plimpton! - Ma'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.56,0:36:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,武器放下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop your weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.77,0:36:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.86,0:36:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,奉博士的指示行事 梅森小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the doctor tells me, Miss Mason.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.32,0:36:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,曼蒂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mandy?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.95,0:36:44.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 没有目击者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, no witnesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.37,0:36:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 搞什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus. What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.75,0:36:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲有好多信在谈轮盘 我没看完{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father wrote so many letters about the Dial, I stopped reading 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.17,0:37:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的不记得我上次去你家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really don't remember the last time I was at your house?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.84,0:37:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时跟他拿的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took that from him then.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.35,0:37:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为他不再想它了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought he'd stopped thinking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.22,0:37:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你爸深信这玩意既真实又危险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But your father was convinced this thing was real and dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.27,0:37:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.65,0:37:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他怕有人发现那块传奇的刻写板{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was terrified that if somebody found this legendary tablet,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.23,0:37:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,格拉飞科{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Grafikos…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.28,0:37:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,指引剩余轮盘下落的刻写板{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tablet containing directions to the rest of the Dial.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.65,0:37:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们发现格拉飞科{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if they found the Grafikos…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.16,0:37:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,就可能取得另一半轮盘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they might acquire the other half of the Dial…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.87,0:37:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,将两者组合起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and put the two together.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.16,0:37:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你不会摧毁它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you wouldn't destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.21,0:37:34.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道他要我摧毁它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know he asked me to destroy it?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.54,0:37:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.75,0:37:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你果然记得那一夜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do remember that night.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.34,0:37:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我才12岁 - 你知道它没掉进河里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was 12 years old, Indy. - You knew we didn't drop it in a river.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.97,0:37:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,老贝没告诉你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baz didn't tell you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.18,0:37:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听我说 我没… - 他从不撒谎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- See, listen. I didn't… - No, he never lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.64,0:37:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 干嘛瞎掰地图的事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. You… - What was all that crap about the map?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.26,0:37:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喝太多威士忌了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you've had too many whiskeys.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.22,0:37:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想干嘛 袋熊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing, Wombat?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.27,0:37:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,留在原地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.85,0:37:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.56,0:37:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这些人是谁 - 我们得快离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are these people? - We need to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.90,0:37:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们跟你一伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are they with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.19,0:37:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动 萧小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not an inch, Miss Shaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.69,0:38:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,萧小姐 站住{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Shaw, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.07,0:38:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,海伦娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helena!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.33,0:38:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.04,0:38:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.12,0:38:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,海伦娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helena!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.17,0:38:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼斯博士 结束了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Jones. It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.17,0:38:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you people?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.71,0:38:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们想干嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.80,0:38:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.80,0:38:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,海伦娜·萧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helena Shaw!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.76,0:38:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在屋顶上 从别的地方上去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's on the roof. Find another way up.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.18,0:38:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼斯博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Jones!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.68,0:38:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼斯博士 我们不会伤害你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Jones, we're not gonna hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.54,0:39:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去追他们 - 快去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Move. We gotta follow 'em. - Go. Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.86,0:39:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,分头追{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fan out!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.88,0:39:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,快…带走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go. Move, move, move! Pack it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.96,0:39:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,全部搬走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Get everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.42,0:39:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到她了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found her!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.99,0:40:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 总机 - 我要报警{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Operator. - I need the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.45,0:40:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨特学院 有人死了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunter College. People are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.91,0:40:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拜托… - 挂断{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please… - Hang up, fella.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.88,0:40:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.43,0:40:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.87,0:40:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,她溜了 你搞砸了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gone. You blew it…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.50,0:41:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,乱开枪的小白脸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you trigger-happy cracker.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.91,0:41:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 东西在她手上 - 逮到教授了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She had it in her hand. - We got the professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.96,0:41:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼斯的档案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the file on Jones.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.30,0:41:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.69,0:41:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.69,0:41:30.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才要问你呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my question.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.66,0:41:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是中情局的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're CIA.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.29,0:41:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, not me, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.12,0:41:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不接政府的案子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't take government jobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.34,0:41:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.71,0:41:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么认识萧小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are you acquainted with Miss Shaw?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.34,0:41:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是我的干女儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's my goddaughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.09,0:41:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有18年没见到她了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't seen her in 18 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.14,0:41:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天为何跟她见面 给她轮盘吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you meet with her today? To give her the Dial?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.72,0:42:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐 那是笨重的老古董{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady, it's an ancient hunk of gears.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.77,0:42:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,半个古董{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half a hunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:03.14,0:42:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只如此{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's a lot more than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.61,0:42:07.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.52,0:42:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想去哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.23,0:42:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里在游行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a parade going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.98,0:42:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,有抗议队伍要过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a demonstration coming down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.32,0:42:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.11,0:42:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂… - 闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey… - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.16,0:42:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边不能走 我得倒车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't go this way. Gotta go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.79,0:42:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,干嘛 你有毛病啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell no! What is wrong with you, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.83,0:42:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶 我们用走的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it! Let's go on foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.46,0:42:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard her.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.34,0:42:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在想什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.38,0:42:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快走 - 你有病啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Walk! Come on. - What is your problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.84,0:42:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 倒车不看路吗 - 搞定那家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't look when you're backin' up? - Take care of that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.51,0:42:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁要赔我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's gonna pay for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.47,0:42:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,别激动 老兄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy, fella. Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.80,0:42:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep movin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.72,0:42:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没看到我的小黄吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't you see my cab? It's yellow.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.60,0:42:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得付板金的钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're gonna have to pay for this bodywork, man. I don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.10,0:42:45.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,要和平…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peace now! Peace now!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.85,0:42:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,停战 停止对抗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop the war! Stop the fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.86,0:42:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要去哪 梅森 - 走这边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are we going, Mason? - This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.65,0:42:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不上战场 - 闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hell no, we won't go. - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.40,0:42:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不上战场 - 绝不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hell no, we won't go! - Hell no!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.16,0:42:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不上战场 - 我们不上战场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hell no, we won't go! - Hell no, we won't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.91,0:43:00.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不上战场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.95,0:43:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不上战场 - 我们不上战场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hell no, we won't go! - Hell no, we won't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.91,0:43:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们… - 闭嘴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hell no… - Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.55,0:43:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不上…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell no…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.48,0:43:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.31,0:43:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察先生 救我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Officer! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.98,0:43:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,警察先生 有枪击…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Officer, there was a shooting…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.36,0:43:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 - 早上在亨特学院{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right, all right. - …this morning at Hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.65,0:43:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人死了 该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}People are dead. God damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.57,0:43:41.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有流氓闯进… - 先生 冷静点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Some rogue maniacs broke in and… - Sir, you need to calm it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.08,0:43:43.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,请听我说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:43.45,0:43:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上发生枪击案{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a shooting this morning, and the…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.75,0:43:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就在角落的联合爱迪生厢型车上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're in a Con Ed van right around the corner!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.75,0:43:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想干嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.60,0:44:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 小心 - 他在干嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Watch out! - What's he doin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.70,0:44:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你成功了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.94,0:44:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move, out the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.28,0:45:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.45,0:45:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.30,0:45:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.90,0:45:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.71,0:46:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 太扯了 是马{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. That's ridiculous. It's a horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.71,0:46:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,停{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.26,0:46:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 先生 - 让开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, mister. - Move! Out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.22,0:46:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉住我的马{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold my horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.22,0:46:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.51,0:46:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,可转乘皇后区大道线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Transfer is available for IND Queens Boulevard.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.69,0:46:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一站 第59街莱辛顿大道站{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next stop, 59th, Lexington Avenue.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.82,0:46:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,地铁比较快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Subway is faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.37,0:46:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,人往往把科学浪漫化 其实它很冷酷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}People tend to romanticize science, when it is, in fact, quite cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.33,0:46:33.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一步呢 史密兹博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's next, Dr. Schmidt?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.96,0:46:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,上火星{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mars?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.83,0:46:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们征服了太空{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we've conquered space.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.09,0:46:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在要进军下一个领域{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm moving to the next frontier.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.30,0:46:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,太空之外还有什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's beyond space?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.30,0:46:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,您可能得熨一下西装 史密兹博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might wanna get that suit pressed, Dr. Schmidt.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.93,0:46:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,一小时后前往机场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We leave for the airport in an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.94,0:46:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要见总统{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna meet the President.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.19,0:46:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果总统在意几条皱折{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the President objects to a few creases…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.86,0:47:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许该另请高明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}perhaps he should find himself another physicist.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.11,0:47:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能引用这句话吗 - 不行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can I use that? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.32,0:47:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.90,0:47:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝斯特{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baxter.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.70,0:47:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,您的电话 博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's for you, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.58,0:47:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能要晚点才去洛杉矶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may wanna leave a bit later for Los Angeles.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.79,0:47:20.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在等一件快递{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm expecting a delivery shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.30,0:47:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,请说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.30,0:47:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的那些饭桶乱搞一通{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your goons made a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.97,0:47:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did they?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.30,0:47:29.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,萧小姐见了一位琼斯教授{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Shaw met with a professor. Jones.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.35,0:47:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她从他手上拿到那个装置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She acquired the device from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.02,0:47:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们追丢了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we lost her.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.77,0:47:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼斯博士也跑了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Jones got away as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.85,0:47:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.19,0:47:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,真可惜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.90,0:47:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得收拾残局 博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta clean things up here, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.48,0:47:44.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,身为美国政府代表{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as a representative of the United States government…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.07,0:47:46.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我建议你乖乖配合{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I urge you to cooperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.86,0:47:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,搭机到洛杉矶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get on that plane to Los Angeles…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.91,0:47:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,从总统手中领取奖章{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and get your medal from the President.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.96,0:47:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.33,0:48:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,打给我们的朋友 安排私人专机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call our friends and secure a private charter.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.13,0:48:03.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,到摩洛哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}To Morocco.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.05,0:48:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.30,0:48:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,大学命案发生在游行高潮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The university murders took place at the height of the parade.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.68,0:48:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方正在寻找退休教授亨利·琼斯博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police are searching for retired professor Dr. Henry Jones.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.26,0:48:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼斯的同事告诉本台 他刚失去儿子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A colleague told ABC that Jones recently lost his son…
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.43,0:48:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在办离婚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and was in the middle of a divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.15,0:48:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个人长得好像你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy, he looks like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.82,0:48:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不像{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nah. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.40,0:48:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.32,0:48:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.32,0:48:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 回家吧 你醉了 - 就是他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go home, pal. You're drunk. - This is the guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.99,0:48:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 凶手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey! - It's the killer!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.87,0:48:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉我迟到了 印第{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry I'm late, Indy.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.54,0:48:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,桥上堵车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bridge traffic.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.84,0:48:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,真高兴见到你 萨拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, am I glad to see you, Sallah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.64,0:48:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿我也能这么说 老朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could say the same, old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.14,0:49:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第 快进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quickly, Indy. Inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.86,0:49:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的干女儿海伦娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your goddaughter, Helena…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.32,0:49:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,去年在丹吉尔被捕{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}was arrested in Tangier last year…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.90,0:49:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,罪名是拍卖走私品{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for auctioning contraband.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.37,0:49:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.49,0:49:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,保她出来的是阿济兹·拉辛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was bailed out by Aziz Rahim.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.67,0:49:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿济兹·拉辛的父亲是大拉辛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aziz Rahim is the son of Big Rahim…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.67,0:49:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,知名的摩洛哥黑帮分子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a well-known Moroccan mobster.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.80,0:49:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,大拉辛拥有丹吉尔的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big Rahim owns the Hotel Atlantique…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.80,0:49:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,大西洋饭店 这个星期{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in Tangier, and this week…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.55,0:49:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,该饭店要举行年度拍卖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the hotel is hosting its annual auction…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.85,0:49:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,销售遭窃的古董{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}of stolen antiquities.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.90,0:49:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,大咖都已经到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the big players are already there.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.56,0:49:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉亚 贾巴利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alia, Jabari.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.52,0:49:51.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是战时带我们家到美国的大好人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the great man who brought our family to America during the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.57,0:49:54.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,快答 苏伊士运河危机发生在何时{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick, when was the Suez Crisis?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.12,0:49:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,1956年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}1956.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.24,0:49:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好厉害 贾巴利{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very impressive, Jabari.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.83,0:50:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我孙子看太多电视{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My grandchildren watch too much TV…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.33,0:50:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们了解自己的历史{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they know their history.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.08,0:50:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们懂怎么当埃及裔美国人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They understand what it is to be American and Egyptian.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.09,0:50:11.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要车子载我到机场 萨拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a ride to the airport, Sallah.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.34,0:50:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你逃走 警方会认定你畏罪潜逃{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you run, the police will assume that you're guilty.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.55,0:50:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有海伦娜和轮盘 我会被诬陷杀人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without Helena or the Dial, I'm gonna get framed for murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.89,0:50:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想过打给玛莉安吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you thought about calling Marion?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.77,0:50:23.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不想跟我说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't wanna talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.07,0:50:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎莅临纽约甘乃迪国际机场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to New York's John F. Kennedy International Airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.70,0:50:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,上层仅供泛美航空乘客下车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The upper level is for Pan American Airlines passenger drop off only.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.16,0:50:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从你的公寓拿了别的东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took something else from your apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.16,0:50:40.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,在床底下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was under the bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.46,0:50:46.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 萨拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Sallah.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.92,0:50:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也带了护照{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I also brought my passport.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.80,0:50:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能帮你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.09,0:50:55.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,在丹吉尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Tangier?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.18,0:50:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wherever chance takes us.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.51,0:50:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第 我…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indy, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.72,0:51:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怀念沙漠{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss the desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.77,0:51:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怀念大海{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.60,0:51:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怀念每天早上醒来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I miss waking up every morning…
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.56,0:51:09.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,想着新的一天会有什么美好冒险{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}wondering what wonderful adventure the new day will bring to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.65,0:51:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是冒险 萨拉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not an adventure, Sallah.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.11,0:51:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种日子过去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those days have come and gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.86,0:51:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.07,0:51:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps not.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.87,0:51:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他们好看 印第安纳·琼斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give 'em hell, Indiana Jones!
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.09,0:51:38.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,香槟吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Champagne?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.55,0:51:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,四小时后抵达丹吉尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got four more hours to Tangier.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.10,0:51:50.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,您的苏格兰威士忌 先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your scotch, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.23,0:51:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.16,0:52:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝索 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Basil. Come on, Baz!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.74,0:52:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 开门 - 不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Open the door! - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.62,0:52:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别进来 印第 - 开门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stay out, Indy! - Open the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.33,0:52:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,德国人说得对 印第{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Germans were right, Indy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.88,0:52:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 它太大 太重要了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - It's too big. It's too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.84,0:52:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Ba… Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.79,0:52:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老贝 给我 - 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Baz! Give me… - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.80,0:52:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在干嘛 - 你没在听我说{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - You've listened to nothing that I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:16.84,0:52:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不懂 老贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand it, Baz!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.30,0:52:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在楼下想解释给你听{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I was trying to explain it to you downstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.30,0:52:23.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你充耳不闻 - 你吓坏你女儿了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You've just ignored everything. - You're terrifying your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.77,0:52:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第 阿基米德…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indy, Archimedes…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.02,0:52:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现了一种时间气象学{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}discovered a temporal meteorology.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.48,0:52:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿基米德是数学家 老贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Archimedes was a mathematician, Baz…
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.23,0:52:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是魔术师{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}not a magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.61,0:52:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能预测时间的裂缝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could predict fissures in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.24,0:52:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间的裂缝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fissures in time?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.11,0:52:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老贝 你无法证明 - 还没{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Baz, you can't prove that! - Well, not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.12,0:52:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,能证明才叫科学{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Proving it is what makes it science!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.51,0:53:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,老贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Baz.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.43,0:53:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我根本不该给你这玩意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never should've given you the thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.68,0:53:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,它应该放在博物馆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It belongs in a museum.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.10,0:53:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托交给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it to me. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.27,0:53:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I give you this…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.98,0:53:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得摧毁它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}it must be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.94,0:53:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.66,0:53:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会摧毁它 老贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll destroy it, Baz.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.58,0:53:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你保证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.79,0:53:34.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.38,0:53:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是我的错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.80,0:53:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你会在这里吗 - 会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you gonna be here? - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.34,0:53:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我得赶飞机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I've gotta catch an airplane.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.59,0:53:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,若有人发现格拉飞科 他们会有两半{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If anyone finds the Grafikos, they'll have both halves.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.55,0:53:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些东西不该曝光{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some things should stay buried.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.05,0:53:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 老贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, Baz.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.97,0:53:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 非摧毁它不可 - 我会的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's vital that you destroy it. - I will, Baz.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.93,0:53:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你懂吗 - 我会摧毁它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you understand? - I'll destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.48,0:53:51.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 说你会 印第 - 对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Say you will, Indy. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.39,0:53:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会 对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will… Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.56,0:53:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你答应我的 别忘了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You promised me. Remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.31,0:53:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will… I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.48,0:53:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有原因…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a reason…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.48,0:53:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿基米德将它一分为二是有原因的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a reason that Archimedes broke it in two.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.32,0:54:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 老贝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, Baz.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:01.15,0:54:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indy.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.03,0:54:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 袋熊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Wombat.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.49,0:54:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他过几天就没事了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna be all right in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.54,0:54:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一降落就打给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll call you as soon as I land.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.04,0:54:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位先生女士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.46,0:54:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将于20分钟后在丹吉尔降落{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we are 20 minutes from landing in Tangier.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.71,0:54:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别喝了 - 你干嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop drinking! - What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.25,0:54:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再喝香槟了 你还要…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more champagne! How many more…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.00,0:54:57.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要留下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm staying.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.04,0:54:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家 回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go home. Go home!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.19,0:55:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,萧小姐 她在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Shaw, she's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.78,0:55:23.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,以青铜制成{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forged in bronze.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.03,0:55:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,近乎完整{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nearly complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.24,0:55:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是一个天文钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is an astrological clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.45,0:55:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自公元前三世纪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dating third century BC…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.83,0:55:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,由阿基米德亲手打造{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and built by Archimedes himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.79,0:55:37.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,起标价2万{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's start at 20, 000.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.37,0:55:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,2万 谢谢您{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}20, 000, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.79,0:55:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,3万 3万{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}30.30.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.13,0:55:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,数据正常{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gauges green…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.75,0:55:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,马力满档{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}power full…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.96,0:55:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,时速达到85英里就仰转{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and when I reach 85, I rotate.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.92,0:55:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What next?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.93,0:55:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 路易 帮他 好可爱 - 拉回驾驶盘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Louis, help him! He's so cute. - Pull back on the yoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.18,0:55:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有 我起飞了 - 他起飞了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I did, man. I'm airborne. - Yeah, he's airborne.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.56,0:55:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我喝一口 - 要收回襟翼吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can I have a sip? - Do I pick up the flaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.14,0:55:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,在400尺以下别碰襟翼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch the flaps under 400 feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.10,0:55:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,缩小俯仰角 时速升到120英里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Decrease your pitch to get to 120.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.73,0:55:57.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.48,0:56:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 私人拍卖会 老先生 - 我得进去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Private auction, old timer. - I've gotta get in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.94,0:56:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,说出通关密语才能进去 这是规定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No password, no entry. I don't make the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.36,0:56:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 目前出价多少 - 5万{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And what is the current bid? - The bid is 50, 000.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.99,0:56:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我出5万5{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I bid 55.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.41,0:56:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁出6万 - 6万{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who'll give me 60? - 60.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.58,0:56:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,6万 6万5呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}60.65?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.08,0:56:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 6万5、7万 - 7万5{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 65.70? - 75.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.50,0:56:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 7万5 8万 - 8万{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 75.80? - 80.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.00,0:56:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 8万5 - 9万呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 85. - How about 90?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.59,0:56:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是私人拍卖会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This auction is private.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.80,0:56:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,拍卖结束了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This auction's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.30,0:56:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,正好相反 刚开始{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Au contraire, it's hardly begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.76,0:56:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 10万 - 10万{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 100. - 100, 000.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.51,0:56:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢这顶帽子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like the hat, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.93,0:56:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你年轻至少两岁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes you look at least two years younger.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.47,0:56:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.85,0:56:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 11万 赞 - 我说拍卖结束了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 110, bravo. - I told you that this auction is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.48,0:56:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问这个人是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, who is this man?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.85,0:56:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是她干爹 - 他算亲戚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm her godfather. - He's mildly related.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.48,0:56:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,超过她的睡觉时间了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And she's up past her bedtime.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.40,0:56:44.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走吧 袋熊 - 劝你别这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, Wombat. - I wouldn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.82,0:56:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,想到酒吧解释给警察听吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to explain it to the cops at the bar?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.61,0:56:47.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我花钱打点过的那些{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ones I paid off?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.57,0:56:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你搞不清楚状况 琼斯哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're out of your depth, Jonesy.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.95,0:56:51.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 琼斯哥 - 他以为我犯法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "Jonesy"? - He thinks I'm a criminal.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.62,0:56:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他才是命案通缉犯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the one wanted for murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.66,0:56:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,报上的大头照挺帅的 13万{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice big picture in the New York Herald. 130?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.87,0:56:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没杀人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't kill anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.66,0:56:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 私人拍卖不得进入 - 你心里有数{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No entry, it's a private auction. - And you know it, Helena.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.46,0:57:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶手正在找这个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But whoever did was looking for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.17,0:57:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿的是潘朵拉的盒子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you've got here is Pandora's Box.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.26,0:57:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.38,0:57:10.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,它是我的盒子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my box.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.47,0:57:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.39,0:57:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们见过吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have we met?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.64,0:57:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.64,0:57:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记忆有点模糊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My memory is a little fuzzy…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.19,0:57:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你很面熟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but your face rings a bell.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.35,0:57:23.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是纳粹吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you still a Nazi?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.65,0:57:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你搞混了 在下史密兹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're confused. My name is Schmidt.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.40,0:57:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿拉巴马大学的史密兹教授{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor Schmidt of Alabama University.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.28,0:57:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,史密兹教授{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor Schmidt.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.66,0:57:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴见到你本人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How nice to meet you in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.62,0:57:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 15万 - 我们谈过之后{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 150. - After our conversation, Miss Shaw…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.54,0:57:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为我们对轮盘达成协议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we'd come to an agreement about the Dial.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.67,0:57:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇了 上次有个很像你的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funny. The last time I saw the other guy who looks like you…
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.92,0:57:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也在找这东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}he was also after this.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.38,0:57:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你原本出价不高 史密兹教授{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your numbers were light, Professor Schmidt.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.17,0:57:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好你来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But good news is, you're here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.63,0:57:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 出价16万 - 你好像不懂 萧小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The bid is 160. - You don't seem to understand, Miss Shaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.09,0:57:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件文物是我的资产{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This relic is my property.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.47,0:57:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,才怪 你用偷的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not yours. You stole it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.10,0:57:55.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你又偷走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you stole it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.05,0:57:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我又偷走 这就是资本主义{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I stole it. It's called capitalism.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.81,0:57:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,出价16万{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bid is 160.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.77,0:57:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 16万 - 17万{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 160. - 170?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.85,0:58:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该待在纽约才对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should've stayed in New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.93,0:58:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 17万 - 你们不该染指波兰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 170? - You should've stayed out of Poland.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.06,0:58:04.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,17万 有人要加价吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}170. Anyone? Anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.06,0:58:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次 两次…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going, going…
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.90,0:58:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,成交{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.57,0:58:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.90,0:58:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,快拿轮盘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the Dial.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.87,0:58:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay away!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.25,0:58:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 克劳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hello, Claude.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.30,0:58:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不该回来的 海伦娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should not have come back, Helena.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.64,0:58:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,别插手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.82,0:58:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰迪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.08,0:59:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉辛叫你留下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rahim says you stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.05,0:59:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.19,0:59:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,到过去相见了 琼斯博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you in the past, Dr. Jones.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.54,0:59:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 让开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.51,1:00:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的出租车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my cab!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.15,1:00:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫他们走开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them to back off.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.35,1:00:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚叫他们朝你开枪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just told them to shoot you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.94,1:00:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 各位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.40,1:00:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪放下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put the guns down.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.07,1:00:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put 'em down.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.37,1:00:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.91,1:00:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样好多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's better.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.92,1:00:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.76,1:00:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉辛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rahim.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.05,1:00:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你穿睡衣{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in pajamas.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.97,1:00:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在睡觉 海伦娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was sleeping, Helena.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.14,1:00:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡得很甜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Peacefully.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.98,1:00:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我爸叫醒我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then my father woke me.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.98,1:00:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说你回饭店了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told me you'd returned to our hotel.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.11,1:00:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着他给我这把弯刀{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he handed me this scimitar…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.32,1:00:59.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫我提你的人头回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and told me to come home with your head.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.41,1:01:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定要是头吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it have to be that bit?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.46,1:01:13.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你是爱我才回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought maybe you returned because you loved me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.21,1:01:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉辛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rahim…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:15.25,1:01:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个物件要卖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had an item to sell.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.84,1:01:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 她说的物件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. The item she's talking about…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.88,1:01:20.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 其实是我的 - 你不必…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- actually belongs to me. - No. You do not need to…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.68,1:01:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有些大坏蛋 - 硬要插话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And some very bad people… - …intrude in this conversation.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.84,1:01:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 更恶劣的人抢走了 - 少管闲事 我的生意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …worse people, have run off with it. - You do not need to get involved with my business.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.18,1:01:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的新欢吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this your new man?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.31,1:01:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是 - 说来复杂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. No, no. - It's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.35,1:01:29.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底欠他什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What exactly do you owe this guy?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.02,1:01:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些保释金和一生的幸福{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just some bail money and a lifetime of happiness.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.27,1:01:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我敢说你把戒指卖了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I presume you sold the ring.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.11,1:01:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,价钱没我想的高{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It didn't go for as much as I thought it would.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.90,1:01:37.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会动手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.28,1:01:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想…喂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you… Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.45,1:01:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你差点害死我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just got me killed!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.12,1:01:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可没跟黑道订婚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm not the one that's engaged to a mobster!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.04,1:01:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,盗墓老贼凭什么说三道四{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need morality lessons from an aging grave robber!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.75,1:01:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是盗墓老贼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a grave robber.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.33,1:01:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸和我一起做过重要的工作{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father and I did important work together.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.84,1:02:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说你那些冒险都是高贵无私的壮举{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't tell me all your escapades were noble, selfless quests.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.34,1:02:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是为了追求刺激{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did it for the buzz!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.01,1:02:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得好 泰迪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good work, Teddy!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.35,1:02:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 过去 小鬼 - 喂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Move over, kid. - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.94,1:02:20.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 海伦娜 - 倒车…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Helena! - Back up! Back up!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.63,1:02:39.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是往这边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not this way!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.59,1:02:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本乱开 印第{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know where you're going, Indy!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.05,1:02:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听他的 他地头蛇 - 丹吉尔我很熟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Listen to him. He knows this town! - I know Tangier!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.39,1:02:48.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.48,1:02:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 再快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Faster. Go faster!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.85,1:02:57.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,十分钟到机场 老大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten minutes to the airport, boss.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.82,1:03:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不确定史密兹是不是教授{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure Professor Schmidt is an actual professor, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.86,1:03:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是纳粹 - 左转{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's a Nazi! - Turn left!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.95,1:03:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,左转…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn left! Turn left!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.66,1:03:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不对 - 不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, no! - No!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.42,1:03:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,海伦娜 别闹了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helena! Don't do this!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.35,1:03:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这边 - 那边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, this way! - That way!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.85,1:03:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.60,1:03:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,海伦娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helena!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:39.36,1:03:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.91,1:03:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.46,1:03:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,海伦娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helena!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.25,1:04:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.34,1:04:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.92,1:04:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.39,1:04:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.22,1:04:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.76,1:04:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想他会感到骄傲吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think he'd be proud of this?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.55,1:04:52.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.22,1:04:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你老爸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.22,1:04:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的独生女为了保释金出卖灵魂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His only daughter selling her soul for bail money!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.31,1:04:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样说还挺不赖的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds quite cool when you put it like that.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.60,1:05:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不全是保释金{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's not all bail money.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.65,1:05:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有的是赌债 - 谢谢哦 泰迪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Some of it's gambling debt and some… - Thank you, Teddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.11,1:05:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,海伦娜 不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helena! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.78,1:05:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,海伦娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helena!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.61,1:05:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么沦落到这地步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you end up like this?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.74,1:05:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说足智多谋吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you mean resourceful?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.24,1:05:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,大胆 美丽 独立自主{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daring? Beautiful? Self-sufficient?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.89,1:05:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.36,1:05:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,走这边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go this way!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.99,1:05:55.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.55,1:06:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 停车 - 喂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop! Stop! - Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.65,1:06:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,在左边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the left!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.86,1:06:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰迪 你来开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the wheel, Teddy!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.15,1:06:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要干嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.44,1:06:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我的东西抢回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting what's mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.78,1:06:33.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,海伦娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helena!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.29,1:06:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶 你疯啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it! You crazy?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.33,1:06:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,海伦娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Helena!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.05,1:06:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拿枪 - 萧小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take the gun! - Miss Shaw.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.26,1:06:52.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,放手 萧小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go, Miss Shaw!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.70,1:07:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,放手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.82,1:07:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 轮盘给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Give me the Dial!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.79,1:07:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,海伦娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helena!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.71,1:07:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.63,1:07:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 调头 他们往那边 - 他走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Turn back! They went that way! - He's gone!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.97,1:07:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让开 - 喂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Move over! - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.26,1:07:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是来从你未婚夫手中拯救你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't come here to rescue you from your fiancé!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.27,1:07:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,拯救我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rescue me?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.19,1:07:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想拿回轮盘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want the Dial back.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.38,1:08:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,手举高{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your hands above your head.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.13,1:08:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们分手得不太漂亮{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the smoothest break-up I ever had.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.76,1:08:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果你爸还活着 - 可惜没有 印第{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If your father was still alive… - Well, he's not, Indy.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.13,1:08:17.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,引擎有问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, something's wrong with the engine.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.68,1:08:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但愿有个像我父亲的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}If only there'd been someone there for me, some father figure…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.89,1:08:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别选定担任这角色的人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}someone specifically anointed for the job.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.72,1:08:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不知道… - 不用自责{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You have no idea about the kind… - Don't beat yourself up about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.31,1:08:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,干爹到底是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what even is a godfather?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.39,1:08:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本来就不懂跟家人相处{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, family never was your strong suit.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.11,1:08:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 几点了 - 嗯…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is the time, by the way? - It's…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.61,1:08:34.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不公平{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, no fair.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.32,1:08:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,还给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me that back.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.70,1:08:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我爸的表{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was my father's watch!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.20,1:08:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,还给他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it back to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.54,1:08:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得自己离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have to leave town with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.12,1:08:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉辛也会找你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rahim will be looking for you too.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.92,1:08:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会先去丹吉尔机场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll go to Tangier airport first…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.04,1:08:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得搭火车 到卡萨布兰加搭机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we'll need to catch a train and get a plane from Casablanca.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.51,1:08:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么声音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.68,1:09:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.93,1:09:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.18,1:09:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.43,1:09:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.69,1:09:11.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,了解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.78,1:09:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们下令停止{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They pulled the plug.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.28,1:09:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吓到他们了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got them scared.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.99,1:09:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 因为他们不懂 - 不对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Because they don't understand. - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.74,1:09:24.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你的同事杀了三个美国平民{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because your associates killed three American civilians…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.33,1:09:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,轰炸全国转播的游行{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and blew up a nationally televised parade.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.62,1:09:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你放美国总统鸽子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you stood up the President of the United States…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.87,1:09:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑到摩洛哥{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}ran to Morocco…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.21,1:09:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,引发一场需要军事撤离的事件{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and created an incident that required military extraction!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.71,1:09:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就带我到华府去解释{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then take me to DC, and I will explain it all.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.59,1:09:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要你消失{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want you to vanish.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.09,1:09:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在一半的轮盘到手了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have half the Dial now.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.39,1:09:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只是想让你开心{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were just trying to keep you happy…
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.72,1:09:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你去追那样东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}letting you chase that thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.56,1:09:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们根本不在乎它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They never cared about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.93,1:09:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,会的 等他们明白它的威力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will, Miss Mason, when they understand what it can do.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.64,1:09:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让人类上月球{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You put them on the moon.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.48,1:09:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们达到目的了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got what they wanted.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.02,1:09:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,系好安全带 准备降落西班牙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, buckle up. We're landing in Spain.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.57,1:09:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,C9运输机会送你去麦斯威尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}C-9 transport will take you from there to Maxwell.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.74,1:10:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不回阿拉巴马{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going back to Alabama!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.40,1:10:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只需要一艘船去地中海{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we need is a vessel to take us to the Mediterranean.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.28,1:10:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,格拉飞科会带我们去其他…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Grafikos will take us to the other…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.83,1:10:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 梅森小姐 拜托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, Miss Mason. Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.04,1:10:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我 史密兹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go of me, Schmidt.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.25,1:10:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我个人请求你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm asking you personally.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.79,1:10:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真难搞 博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a piece of work, Doc.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.92,1:10:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.74,1:10:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,史密兹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Schmidt…
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.20,1:10:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我姓佛勒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Voller.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.83,1:10:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤根`佛勒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jürgen Voller.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.26,1:11:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是海种马{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a Sea Stallion.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.22,1:11:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,美军直升机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}American helicopter.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.64,1:11:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道莱特兄弟吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know the Wright Brothers?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.81,1:11:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 莱特兄弟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - The Wright Brothers.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.43,1:11:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥维尔和威布尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Orville and Wilbur.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.69,1:11:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们发明飞机 住在印第安纳州{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They invented the airplane, and they lived in Indiana.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.10,1:11:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,威布尔在印第安纳出生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wilbur was born in Indiana.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.81,1:11:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是印第安纳人 泰迪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not from Indiana, Teddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.40,1:11:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱特兄弟出生于南北战争时期{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the Wright Brothers were born during the Civil War.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.11,1:11:25.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你可能是他们同学{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I thought maybe you went to school with them.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.66,1:11:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 印第 挺好笑的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on, Indy. That was funny.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.28,1:11:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Funny"?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.25,1:11:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟抛锚嘟嘟车和两个贼困在丹吉尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm stuck in Tangier with a broken tuk-tuk and two thieves.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.12,1:11:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为命案遭通缉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm wanted for murder.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.54,1:11:38.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳粹拿到半个阿基米德轮盘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nazis have half of Archimedes' Dial…
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.54,1:11:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你爸的笔记本{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your father's notebooks.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.00,1:11:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有副本{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a copy.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.17,1:11:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸的笔记本 我抄了一份{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's notebooks. I made a copy.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.55,1:11:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.76,1:11:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你背下五本笔记{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You memorized five notebooks?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.89,1:11:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,七本 当然没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven. And of course not.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.26,1:11:51.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中一半无聊到爆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half of them were as dull as ditch water.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.77,1:11:55.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只背重要的部分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the really important bits.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.19,1:11:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,譬如{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like what?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.52,1:11:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,格拉飞科的位置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The location of the Grafikos.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.81,1:12:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人知道格拉飞科在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody knows where the Grafikos is.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.82,1:12:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸知道 - 才怪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad did. - No, he didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.11,1:12:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他知道 - 不知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, he did. - No, he didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.53,1:12:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他知道 - 格拉飞科是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes, he did. - What's a Grafikos?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.32,1:12:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到其余轮盘的指南{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's directions to the rest of the Dial.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.78,1:12:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,问她用哪种语言写的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask her if she knows what language it's in.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.57,1:12:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是语言 是密码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It isn't in a language. It's in a code.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.53,1:12:11.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么密码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What code?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.91,1:12:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿基米德使用两种密码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Archimedes used two codes.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.54,1:12:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,线形文字B和波利比奥斯方阵密码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Linear B and Polybius Square.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.25,1:12:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算你找到 没有我你也看不懂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, even if you find the Grafikos, without me, you can't read it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.13,1:12:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.71,1:12:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸在我九岁时教我波利比奥斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad taught me Polybius when I was nine.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.59,1:12:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在家里到处留下小字条{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Used to leave little notes around the house.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.34,1:12:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,「整理房间」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Tidy your room."
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.42,1:12:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,「别碰我的白兰地」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Stay away from my brandy."
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.97,1:12:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果那是线形文字B呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if it's Linear B?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.85,1:12:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打赌是波利比奥斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}50 quid it's Polybius.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.26,1:12:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me that.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.43,1:12:34.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.89,1:12:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,没用啦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That won't work.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.27,1:12:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,摩洛哥人嚼铁线子树汁做的口香糖{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moroccan chewing gum's made from the sap of the Manilkara.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.69,1:12:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,它能抗热{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heat resistant.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.27,1:12:42.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,发动看看{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try and start it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.74,1:12:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 发动 - 我在试了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Start it. - I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.87,1:12:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.16,1:12:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎样 - 撑不久的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Huh? - It won't hold.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.91,1:12:56.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,能载我们到火车站{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll get us to the train station.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.00,1:12:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Us"?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.29,1:12:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要回家 - 不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You goin' home? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.67,1:13:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去卡萨布兰加{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to Casablanca.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.38,1:13:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后搭飞机去爱琴海{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I'm gonna hop a plane to the Aegean.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.59,1:13:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.88,1:13:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们干嘛去爱琴海{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes you think we're going to the Aegean?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.63,1:13:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得抢在纳粹之前找到格拉飞科{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta get to the Grafikos before the Nazis.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.09,1:13:11.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿基米德被罗马人包围{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Archimedes was surrounded by Romans.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.39,1:13:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,它还会在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where else would it be?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.01,1:13:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱琴海很大 印第{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Aegean is huge, Indy.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.18,1:13:16.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也没座标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you don't have coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.48,1:13:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有船{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you don't have a boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.85,1:13:23.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在希腊有个老朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got an old friend in Greece.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.65,1:13:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,专业潜水夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An expert diver.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.28,1:13:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一艘又大又漂亮的船{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}With a big, beautiful boat…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.07,1:13:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,能抢在他们之前载我们过去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that'll get us there before they will.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.95,1:13:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need me…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.20,1:13:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很清楚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.54,1:14:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞尼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Renny!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.88,1:14:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indy?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.80,1:14:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indy!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.35,1:14:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是专业潜水夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, that's the expert diver?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.39,1:14:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,西班牙头号蛙人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spain's greatest frogman.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.56,1:14:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.56,1:14:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,西班牙头号蛙人只有破船和一条腿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Spain's greatest frogman has a shit boat and only one good frog leg?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.36,1:14:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,别乱讲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.07,1:14:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你换船了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a different boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.53,1:14:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,少罗唆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.80,1:15:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要去这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.47,1:15:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们发现部分安提基瑟拉仪的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where they found the first part of the Antikythera.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.89,1:15:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.35,1:15:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要潜得更深{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're going deeper.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.22,1:15:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸找到发现轮盘的海绵潜水夫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad tracked down the old sponge diver who found the Dial.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.27,1:15:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跟他说…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told him…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.44,1:15:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那艘罗马沉船解体的地点在…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the wrecked Roman ship broke up under the sea…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.57,1:15:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,海面下20米{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}70 feet below.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.86,1:15:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面有100多个罗马百夫长的骨骸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Filled with the skeletons of over 100 centurions.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.99,1:15:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他们发现它的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where they found it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.78,1:15:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他说船只大部分都瓦解了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he said that most of the ship had broken off…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.20,1:15:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,沉入海床{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and sunk to the ocean floor.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.70,1:15:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,海绵潜水夫下不去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too deep for sponge divers.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.33,1:15:48.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸开始想一艘罗马战舰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Dad started wondering why a Roman warship…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.34,1:15:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何会载100个百夫长离开叙拉古{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}would sail out of Syracuse with 100 centurions on board.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.30,1:15:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是带半个轮盘去兜风的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They weren't taking half a Dial for a joyride.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.64,1:16:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有格拉飞科{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They had the Grafikos…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.10,1:16:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,想找另一半的轮盘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they were looking for the rest of the Dial.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.57,1:16:14.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸真是天才{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad was a genius.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.82,1:16:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.28,1:16:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.18,1:16:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑桃7{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven of spades.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.31,1:16:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.72,1:16:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.60,1:16:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it again.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.23,1:16:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,选一张 琼斯博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pick a card, Dr. Jones.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.74,1:17:00.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑桃7{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven of spades!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.08,1:17:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她太神了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's magic.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.29,1:17:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔术牌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trick deck.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:05.62,1:17:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.79,1:17:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我操控选牌过程{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I force the card.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.37,1:17:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给冤大头…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I offer the mark…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.63,1:17:11.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}you…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:11.96,1:17:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,有选择的感觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the feeling of a choice…
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.34,1:17:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但最后我让你挑中我要的牌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but ultimately, I make you pick the card I want.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.67,1:17:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,冤大头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The mark."
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.89,1:17:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 明天是大日子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Tomorrow is a big day.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:23.89,1:17:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得检查氧气管{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to check the lines.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.77,1:17:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.98,1:17:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得你爸的笔记里有什么日期吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember seeing any dates in your father's notebooks?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.57,1:17:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,日期{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dates?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.99,1:17:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么日期{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What dates?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.16,1:17:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些日期{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}These dates.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:48.91,1:17:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这封信上一再写到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Written over and over again in this letter.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.79,1:17:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,1969年8月20日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}August 20th, 1969.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.80,1:17:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,距离现在三天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's three days from now.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.51,1:17:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有1939年同一天{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the same date in 1939.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.92,1:18:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,希特勒入侵波兰前两周{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two weeks before Hitler invades Poland.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.80,1:18:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.56,1:18:07.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你相信轮盘有魔力了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you believe the Dial has magical powers?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.18,1:18:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信魔法 袋熊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe in magic, Wombat.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.11,1:18:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这辈子见识过几次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But a few times in my life, I've seen things.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.61,1:18:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法解释的事情{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things I can't explain.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.70,1:18:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我渐渐认为重点不在…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I've come to believe it's not so much…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.24,1:18:26.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你相信什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}what you believe.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.54,1:18:28.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是你有多么相信{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's how hard you believe it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.92,1:18:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也见识过一些事 印第{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen things too, Indy.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.33,1:18:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,世上唯一值得相信的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing worth believing in, ever…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.88,1:18:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}is cash.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.84,1:18:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.47,1:18:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是能回到过去呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if you could go back in time?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.19,1:18:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会做什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.40,1:18:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,见证特洛伊战争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witness the Trojan War?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:56.32,1:18:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟埃及艳后见面{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check in on Cleopatra?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.28,1:19:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会阻止我儿子入伍{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd stop my son from enlisting.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:06.58,1:19:08.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从军是为了讨好你吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he sign up to please you?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.58,1:19:11.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 为了惹火我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he signed up to piss me off.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.25,1:19:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会怎么阻止他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would you have stopped him?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.63,1:19:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他说他会没命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd tell him he was gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.52,1:19:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟他说他的母亲会…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd tell him that his mother would…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.02,1:19:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤心一辈子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}find no end to her grief.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.69,1:19:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的父亲会…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that his father would be…
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.28,1:19:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法安慰她{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}helpless to console her.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.49,1:19:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的婚姻也会因此告终{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that the loss would put an end to their marriage.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.01,1:20:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还戴着婚戒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still wearing the ring.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.62,1:20:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,有搞头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promising.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.83,1:20:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,更有搞头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}More promising.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.26,1:20:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.55,1:20:51.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿好装备 他们在等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your gear on. They're waiting.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.19,1:20:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:58.27,1:20:59.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.11,1:21:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.69,1:21:02.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你看个东西{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna show you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.65,1:21:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这看起来好重要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gosh, this looks important.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.86,1:21:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,绳子绕过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Around the rope…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.86,1:21:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会潜得很深{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we are going deep.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.28,1:21:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,快速下降 透过这些管子呼吸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Descend fast, and breathe through these hoses.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.08,1:21:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,懂吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.50,1:21:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,彼此要分开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay separate.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.21,1:21:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要互相交错 好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No crisscross. All right?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.08,1:21:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能待太久{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cannot stay long.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.67,1:21:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个方法 通常能避免潜水夫病{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a method that usually prevents the bends.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.01,1:21:26.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 通常 - 对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Usually? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.22,1:21:27.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我称为「弹跳」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I call it "the bounce."
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.59,1:21:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,快速下降{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, fast down…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.55,1:21:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,三分钟到底部 然后上来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}three minutes on the bottom, and then up.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.72,1:21:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,三分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three minutes!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.05,1:21:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,一秒都不多{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one more second.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.56,1:21:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,三分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.89,1:21:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.06,1:21:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的打火机呢 - 不知道 船长{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is my lighter? - I don't know, capitán.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.98,1:21:40.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,该出发了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.86,1:21:44.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,先问一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick question.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:44.94,1:21:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.28,1:21:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鲨鱼吗 - 不是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're sharks? - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.90,1:21:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里没有鲨鱼 是鳗鱼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. No sharks here. Eels.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.45,1:21:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,鳗鱼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eels?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.45,1:21:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧洲鳗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anguilas.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.53,1:21:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,大部分都很小{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most are small.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.83,1:21:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,大的会有两米{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes they are big. Two meters.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.66,1:21:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到它们就别动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you see them, stay still.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.87,1:22:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们咬人会紧咬不放{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They bite you, they lock the jaw. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.25,1:22:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来很像蛇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They look like snakes.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:04.55,1:22:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,才怪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.96,1:22:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,上兵白兰地报到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Private Brandy reporting for duty.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.22,1:22:09.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不去吗 泰迪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not coming, Teddy?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.88,1:22:11.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会游泳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't swim.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.18,1:22:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,算他好运{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky him.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.47,1:22:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都能游泳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone can swim.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.56,1:22:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,手臂伸出收回 伸出收回{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reach and pull. Reach and pull.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.64,1:22:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟海特注意我们的管子{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. You stay here with Hector and watch our lines.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.73,1:22:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间到了 各位{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is time, camarada.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.38,1:24:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,两分钟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two minutes?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.68,1:25:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.60,1:26:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.51,1:27:03.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.48,1:27:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,海伦娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helena!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.91,1:27:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,上来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.87,1:27:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,对…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. That's it. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.50,1:27:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.61,1:27:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are these people?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.36,1:28:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,纳粹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nazis.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.36,1:28:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,琼斯博士 你先还给我轮盘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, you return my Dial, Dr. Jones…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.20,1:28:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在又带格拉飞科给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now, you bring me the Grafikos.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.03,1:28:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴你退休后还是一尾活龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very happy you're not wasting in retirement.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.58,1:28:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有机会就该杀了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have retired you when I had the chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.12,1:28:14.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的赞助者呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are your sponsors?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.41,1:28:16.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在独立作业{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on my own now.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.17,1:28:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间往前走 琼斯博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things move forward, Dr. Jones.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.00,1:28:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And sometimes…
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.80,1:28:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,往后退{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}they go backward.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.84,1:28:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们坐下来好好聊聊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, let's get comfortable and have a little talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.16,1:28:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么语言{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What language is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.71,1:28:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是语言{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a language.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.59,1:29:00.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是密码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a code.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.59,1:29:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,波利比奥斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Polybius.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.34,1:29:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你欠我50镑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You owe me 50 quid.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.93,1:29:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,波利比奥斯密码不熟吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not familiar with Polybius cipher?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.89,1:29:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不熟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.64,1:29:12.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来你熟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it appears you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.44,1:29:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,请看一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Read it, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:25.65,1:29:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.53,1:29:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indy…
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.63,1:29:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在想帮忙了吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feeling helpful now?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.34,1:29:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:53.35,1:29:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倒背如流{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know this stuff backwards.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.72,1:29:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:57.52,1:29:58.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 印第{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Indy.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.85,1:30:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会壮烈牺牲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't do noble death.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.90,1:30:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,只做…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.02,1:30:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷酷无情的数学{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}cold, hard maths.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:04.11,1:30:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我破解密码 帮你找到另一半{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I crack the code, help you find the other half.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.15,1:30:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,10万 付现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}One hundred grand. Cash.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.95,1:30:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,海伦娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helena…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.82,1:30:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要拉倒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it or leave it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.33,1:30:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,一言为定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a deal.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.97,1:30:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他绝对不会付钱给你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll never pay you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.30,1:30:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会发现这比你要的价钱更有价值{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you will find this is worth more than your asking price.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:43.61,1:30:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 泰迪 - 海伦娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Teddy. - Helena…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.27,1:30:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要这么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.86,1:30:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,来解密吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's see what we've got here.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.45,1:30:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我的马卡纳…」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"My Makhana…"
Dialogue: 0,1:30:57.49,1:30:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思是「机器」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's "machine"…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.58,1:31:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,「留在我身旁 在我离开的城市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"lies with me, in the city I left.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.38,1:31:05.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里的狼教人走路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Where wolves teach men to walk."
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.00,1:31:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我躺在九之一底下」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Under one of nine, I lie."
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.80,1:31:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有一种东西能永远躺着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only one thing lies anywhere forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.68,1:31:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,死人 如果轮盘留在他身旁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dead. So, if the Dial lies with him, then…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.06,1:31:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是前往他陵墓的指引{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}then this is directions to his tomb.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.27,1:31:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿基米德之墓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Tomb of Archimedes?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.02,1:31:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,两千年来无人发现{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Undiscovered for two millennia.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.90,1:31:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我离开的城市」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The city I left."
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.61,1:31:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿基米德生前住过两个地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Archimedes lived two places his entire life,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.78,1:31:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他只离开一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so he only left one.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.95,1:31:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人知道吗 后面的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone? At the back?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.83,1:31:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 印第 大家都知道{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Indy. Everyone knows this.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.54,1:31:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括这个小丑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even this clown.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.54,1:31:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚历山大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Alexandria.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.04,1:31:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,100分{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full marks.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.33,1:31:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,狼的希腊文是「莱可斯」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, "wolf" in Greek is "lycos."
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.67,1:31:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是「学校」的字根{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Root of the word "lycaeum" or "school."
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.84,1:31:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,「走路」的多利克文是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the Doric for "walking" is…
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.13,1:31:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,「佩利提欧」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"peripatio."
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.26,1:31:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个字刚好也是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which also happens to be the word for…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.27,1:32:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你博学多闻呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were a bright spark.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.77,1:32:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,「佩利提欧」意思是「走路」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Peripatio" means "walking"…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:12.11,1:32:14.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,但也有「计算」的意思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it also means "counting."
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.70,1:32:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以「狼教人走路」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, "Where wolves teach men to walk"…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:18.58,1:32:20.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可能是… - 数学学院{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- could be… - The School of Mathematics.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.20,1:32:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is correct.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.83,1:32:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一句就简单了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, the next bit is easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:26.79,1:32:28.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,「躺在九之一底下」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Beneath one of nine"?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.55,1:32:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,缪思有九个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are nine Muses.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:31.13,1:32:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,「缪思恩」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Museon.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.09,1:32:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚历山大大图书馆的希腊文{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Greek word for the Great Library of Alexandria.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.97,1:32:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道有九尊雕像支撑着屋顶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which, as we all know, has nine statues supporting its roof.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.93,1:32:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,借我哈一口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.10,1:32:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:43.39,1:32:46.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,九个缪思女神 顺序倒过来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The nine Muses, in reverse order…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.60,1:32:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡利俄佩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}are Calliope…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.77,1:32:50.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,乌拉妮亚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Urania…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.28,1:32:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,波丽姆妮亚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Polymnia…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.44,1:32:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爱拉托 - 波丽姆妮亚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Erato… - Polymnia.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.41,1:32:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅莉什么的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and Meli whasisname…
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.95,1:32:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that other one…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.83,1:33:01.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔利亚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thalia…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.66,1:33:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧忒耳佩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Euteroe…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.62,1:33:05.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但第一个是…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the first is…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.25,1:33:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,克丽欧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clio.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:09.00,1:33:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,历史与时间的缪思{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Muse of history and time.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.34,1:33:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个阿基米德…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That Archimedes…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:11.71,1:33:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好聪明的家伙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}what a clever bugger.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:12.50,1:33:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,陵墓入口在数学学院旁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The entrance to the tomb is by the School of Mathematics…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.22,1:33:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,克丽欧雕像底下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}under a statue of Clio…
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.30,1:33:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚历山大大图书馆遗址{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the ruins of the Great Library of Alexandria.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.14,1:33:21.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,天才博士好棒棒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gold star for Dr. Brains.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.72,1:33:23.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰迪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teddy!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.07,1:33:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,格拉飞科 快去拿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Grafikos, get it!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.97,1:34:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前说过 我要再说一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have said it before, and I will say it again!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.85,1:34:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,走投无路 就用炸药{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you're in a tight spot, dynamite.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.23,1:34:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我朋友刚刚遇害{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friend was just murdered.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.32,1:34:18.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.36,1:34:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟他们全招了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told them everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.95,1:34:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,一字不漏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Word for word.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.83,1:34:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但阿基米德没那么简单{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Archimedes didn't make it that easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.33,1:34:27.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,陵墓不在亚历山大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tomb isn't in Alexandria.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.80,1:34:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you see?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:43.43,1:34:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,波利比奥斯方阵密码{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Polybius square.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.76,1:34:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么材料{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Made of?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:49.43,1:34:50.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜡和木头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wax and wood.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.27,1:34:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything else?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.11,1:34:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,很重{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's heavy.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.03,1:35:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,太重了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too heavy.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.28,1:35:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me that.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.62,1:35:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是纯金{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is solid gold?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.49,1:35:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,古老黄金{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ancient gold.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.20,1:35:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自尼罗河{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the Nile.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.92,1:35:53.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿一下 泰迪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it, Teddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.39,1:36:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,卖掉这玩意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sell this thing…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:06.64,1:36:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,还清债务还有剩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we are out of the hole and then some.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.31,1:36:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有客户会买{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have just the customer.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.56,1:36:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 直布罗陀女公爵 - 送到博物馆{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cranky, old Duchess in Gibraltar… - This is going in a museum.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.85,1:36:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你掌舵 泰迪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the wheel, Teddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.03,1:36:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面写什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does it say?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.16,1:36:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,「寻觅狄奥尼修斯…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Search where Dionysius…
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.83,1:36:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,听见每个低语…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"hears each whisper…"
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.67,1:36:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,宛如飓风之处」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"like a hurricane."
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.29,1:36:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,耳朵{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Ear.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.42,1:36:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,狄奥尼修斯洞穴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cave of Dionysius.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.09,1:36:45.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:46.51,1:36:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,西西里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In Sicily.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.05,1:36:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们有多少燃料 - 一整箱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How much fuel have we got? - It's full.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:00.15,1:37:01.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们往西走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're heading west.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.53,1:37:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是往东{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not east.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.47,1:37:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要吃木瓜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want the papaya.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.56,1:37:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,多少钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.06,1:37:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.82,1:37:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,看那个戴草帽的男孩{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that kid with the straw hat.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.15,1:37:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.03,1:37:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.91,1:37:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好看吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.96,1:38:01.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在干嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.84,1:38:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,等洞穴关门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waiting for closing time at the caves.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:04.59,1:38:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面都是游客{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's crawling with tourists.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:06.34,1:38:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以现在他是老大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so he's, like, running the show now?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:10.14,1:38:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是老大 泰迪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not running the show, Teddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:12.93,1:38:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们做这件事的动机根本不对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just thought we were in this for all the wrong reasons.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:16.60,1:38:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.10,1:38:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,无庸置疑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most assuredly.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.36,1:38:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他绝对不会让我们卖那玩意{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know he's never gonna let us sell any of that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.65,1:38:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,状况还在我掌控中 泰迪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still in charge, Teddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:28.49,1:38:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,海伦娜 过来帮我一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helena, get over here! Give me a hand!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.41,1:38:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,卯起来血拼哦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You splurged.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.87,1:38:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的背包{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's your backpack.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.00,1:38:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个小鬼呢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the kid?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.97,1:38:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, watch it!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.56,1:38:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,有毛病啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:26.50,1:39:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:29.17,1:39:30.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.14,1:39:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.22,1:39:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.15,1:39:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我 让我走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off me! Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.03,1:39:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:02.08,1:40:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,海伦娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helena!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:04.33,1:40:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们抓走泰迪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've got Teddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.09,1:40:09.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们带他到山上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They took him up the hill somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.78,1:40:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会对他怎样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are they gonna do to him?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.03,1:40:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道耳朵 格拉飞科写什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He knows about the Ear, what the Grafikos says.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.07,1:40:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会伤害他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not gonna hurt him.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.70,1:40:38.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会利用他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna use him…
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.62,1:40:40.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到另一半轮盘{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to get the other half of the Dial.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.04,1:40:42.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得抢先一步{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We gotta get there first.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.18,1:40:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,殖民女王在西西里建造许多城市{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Colonizing queens built many cities in Sicily.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.39,1:41:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这座神殿… - 我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The temple… - Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:01.56,1:41:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是最古老的希腊神殿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is the oldest of the Greek temples.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.19,1:41:06.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,洞穴在那边{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cave's over there.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.86,1:41:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,能开快一点吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could we go a little faster, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.67,1:41:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,狄奥尼修斯之耳{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Ear of Dionysius.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.09,1:41:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.32,1:41:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,「寻觅狄奥尼修斯{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Search where Dionysius.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:54.03,1:41:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,听见每个低语 宛如飓风之处」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}hears each whisper like a hurricane."
Dialogue: 0,1:41:57.03,1:41:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好大的回音{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's some echo.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:59.78,1:42:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续发出声音 看哪里最大声{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep making noise till we find out where it's loudest.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.80,1:42:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,停{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.56,1:42:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:34.65,1:42:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,希腊三角楣饰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greek pediment.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.82,1:42:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,入口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}An entrance.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.24,1:42:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Used to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:43.53,1:42:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,新月{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A crescent.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.33,1:42:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟格拉飞科上的一样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like on the Grafikos.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.05,1:42:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想上面有个开口{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think there's an opening up there.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.68,1:43:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在上面还好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay up there?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.72,1:43:07.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,还好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.60,1:43:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没动{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not moving.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.94,1:43:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在思考{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:18.11,1:43:18.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,思考什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}About?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.15,1:43:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我干嘛离地十几米{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}About what the hell I'm doing up here, 40 feet in the air…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.41,1:43:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,肩膀明明快废了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with crap shoulders…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:25.16,1:43:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,脊椎弯曲无力{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}crumbling vertebrae…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.12,1:43:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,一腿装了骨板 一腿装螺丝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a plate in one leg, screws in the other.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.79,1:43:30.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我了解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I get it. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:31.67,1:43:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才不了解{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:33.63,1:43:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你年纪只有我的一半{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're half my age.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:35.88,1:43:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没被迫喝下迦梨的血{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't been forced to drink the blood of Kali.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.71,1:43:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 有道理{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:40.80,1:43:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,或惨遭巫毒教凌虐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or been tortured with voodoo.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:43.93,1:43:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你也没中弹九次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm just guessing, but I don't think you've been shot nine times…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.85,1:43:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括你父亲那一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}including once by your father.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.06,1:43:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸对你开枪了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad shot you?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.10,1:43:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟我说话{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.35,1:43:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上去 我会跟上{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go ahead. I'll follow you.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.28,1:44:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.41,1:44:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们关闭了…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are close. We are close.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.12,1:44:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,看一下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look around you.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:08.29,1:44:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 关闭了 - 狄奥尼修斯洞穴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We are close. - The Cave of Dionysius.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.91,1:44:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:11.00,1:44:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,洞穴关闭整修{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cave is closed for renovation.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:14.92,1:44:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再问一次{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me ask again.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.04,1:44:17.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,狄奥尼修斯洞穴在哪里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is the Cave of Dionysius?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.61,1:44:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样 担心那个小鬼吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter? You worried about the kid?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.07,1:44:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定他们不会伤害他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure they won't hurt him?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.90,1:44:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不会有事的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:44.28,1:44:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很精明{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's smart.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:47.20,1:44:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在哪找到他的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you find him?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:50.37,1:44:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他十岁在马拉喀什赌场外想偷我钱包{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He tried to steal my purse outside a casino in Marrakesh when he was 10.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.12,1:44:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不断用车门撞他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hit him repeatedly with my car door…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:57.38,1:44:59.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不放手 我也不罢休{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he didn't let go and neither did I.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.80,1:45:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,后来就混在一起了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, been together ever since.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:02.46,1:45:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你只关心钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought you were all about the money.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:05.55,1:45:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.64,1:45:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人会把亡父的笔记本背得滚瓜烂熟{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody memorizes every page of their dead father's notebooks…
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.85,1:45:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,只为了钱{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the money.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:21.57,1:45:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛勒先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Herr Voller!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.20,1:45:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们往那边走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They went that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:44.92,1:45:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.89,1:45:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,快啊…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.47,1:45:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:00.23,1:46:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my…
Dialogue: 0,1:46:04.15,1:46:05.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.70,1:46:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:08.03,1:46:09.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 - 不…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, God! - No, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:10.20,1:46:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God! Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:16.12,1:46:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在我身上吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are they off me?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:17.46,1:46:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把它们弄掉 - 不…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get 'em off! - No, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:18.42,1:46:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 弄掉 - 等等{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get 'em off! - Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:32.68,1:46:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:36.68,1:46:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,甲烷{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Methane.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.27,1:46:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,憋气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't breathe.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.69,1:46:41.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,憋气{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't breathe?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:45.36,1:46:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得赶快离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've gotta get outta here.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.66,1:46:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,雅典娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Athena.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:58.33,1:46:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争女神{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddess of war.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:02.50,1:47:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是理性女神{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And reason.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.01,1:47:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,「在月亮底下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Under the moon…"
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.68,1:47:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命在她脚边」{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}"life lies at her feet."
Dialogue: 0,1:47:21.44,1:47:22.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,排水体积测量法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Water displacement.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.56,1:47:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,进池里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in the pool!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:24.82,1:47:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么 帮我开门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Help me open the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.23,1:47:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没从门出去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they didn't get out the doors!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.07,1:47:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来池子里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in the pool!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:30.99,1:47:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我进来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'm getting in the pool.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.03,1:47:34.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:36.87,1:47:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿基米德非常着迷…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Archimedes was fascinated…
Dialogue: 0,1:47:40.41,1:47:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,排水体积测量法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}by water displacement!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.58,1:48:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:24.92,1:48:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷柏{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Klaber!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:39.89,1:48:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,没必要这样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need to do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:07.21,1:49:08.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.09,1:49:10.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me that!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:11.84,1:49:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:20.18,1:49:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave them.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:22.35,1:49:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说别管他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said leave them.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:48.42,1:49:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,伸出拉回{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reach and pull.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.84,1:49:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,伸出拉回{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reach and pull.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:51.88,1:49:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,伸出拉回{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reach and pull.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:22.49,1:50:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿基米德之墓{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Archimedes' tomb.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.98,1:50:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住那一角{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab that corner.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:40.70,1:51:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indy.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:43.91,1:51:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这檐壁饰带…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This frieze…
Dialogue: 0,1:51:47.95,1:51:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是凤凰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a phoenix.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:49.37,1:51:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,常见的图像{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A common icon.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:50.33,1:51:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不常见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Look, it isn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:53.71,1:51:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只凤凰有螺旋桨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This phoenix has propellers.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.30,1:52:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,它怎么会在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:14.56,1:52:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,时钟在一千年后才发明出来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clocks won't be invented for 1, 000 years…
Dialogue: 0,1:52:18.23,1:52:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,更别说是表{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}much less watches.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:22.11,1:52:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿基米德用过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Archimedes used it.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:26.99,1:52:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸说得对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad was right.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:29.12,1:52:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,它有用{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It works.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:30.20,1:52:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然有用 萧小姐{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course it works, Miss Shaw.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:34.46,1:52:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,数学是有用的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mathematics works.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:36.84,1:52:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,它战胜了空间 也会战胜时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As it conquered space, it will conquer time.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:47.80,1:52:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经失去儿子了 琼斯博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've already lost your son, Dr. Jones.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:49.81,1:52:50.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太太离开了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your wife is gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:50.85,1:52:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道还想失去干女儿{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really want to lose your godchild?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:55.90,1:52:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:57.36,1:52:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这世界再也不在乎我们这种男人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A world that no longer cares about men like us.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:11.04,1:53:11.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:50.70,1:53:51.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,历史最伟大的一刻{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}History's greatest moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:59.00,1:54:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,它的终结{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Its end.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:08.14,1:54:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪丢给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw me the gun!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:19.35,1:54:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,带他离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him outta here.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.81,1:54:21.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰迪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:22.73,1:54:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰迪…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teddy! Teddy!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:24.03,1:54:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:25.28,1:54:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:30.24,1:54:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:35.54,1:54:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indy!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:38.21,1:54:39.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:39.54,1:54:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:40.92,1:54:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:45.51,1:54:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在要怎样{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:48.63,1:54:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,带他走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring him.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:57.73,1:54:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,海伦娜 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helena, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:54:58.64,1:55:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 泰迪 不能丢下他 - 不会{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Teddy, we can't just leave him. - We're not!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:00.23,1:55:01.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我走{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow me!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:03.57,1:55:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,快{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:08.45,1:55:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:23.75,1:55:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰迪 快走 我们有车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teddy. Come on. We've got a car.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:30.63,1:55:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crap.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:37.60,1:55:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,待在这{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay there.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:57.74,1:55:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hop on.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:02.50,1:56:05.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一个半球设定目的地{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first hemisphere sets the destination.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:06.80,1:56:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二个以亚历山大座标{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The second calculates the location of the fissure…
Dialogue: 0,1:56:11.80,1:56:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,计算裂缝的位置{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}in Alexandrine coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:14.26,1:56:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫梅斯纳把这转换成经纬度{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have Messner transpose this to longitude and latitude…
Dialogue: 0,1:56:17.97,1:56:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,再把航点传给飞行员{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and transmit way points to the pilots.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:31.99,1:56:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,抄近路{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shortcut.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:37.78,1:56:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 座标37.07 - 是谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got coordinates for 37.07. - So, who is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:42.92,1:56:44.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,丘吉尔{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Churchill?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:45.33,1:56:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾森豪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ike?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:48.71,1:56:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要杀谁才能赢得战争{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you gonna kill to win the war?
Dialogue: 0,1:56:52.17,1:56:55.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,几分钟后 在阿基米德的加持下{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a few minutes, with the help of Archimedes…
Dialogue: 0,1:56:55.22,1:56:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将飞进暴风眼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}we shall fly into the eye of this storm…
Dialogue: 0,1:56:57.89,1:57:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,通过西西里领空{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and cross into Sicilian airspace…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:00.31,1:57:03.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,在1939年8月20日{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}on August 20th, 1939.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:04.56,1:57:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,往北飞越盟国 油料足以飞到慕尼黑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will head north over friendly skies with enough fuel to reach Munich.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:09.40,1:57:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的猎物会等着我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My quarry will be waiting for me…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:11.19,1:57:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,在摄政王街16号{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}at 16 Prinzregentenplatz…
Dialogue: 0,1:57:14.40,1:57:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备升级他的V1火箭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}for an update on his V-1 rocket.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:23.62,1:57:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪有纳粹会杀元首的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of Nazi kills the Führer?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:29.21,1:57:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信胜利的那种 琼斯博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kind that believes in victory, Dr. Jones.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:37.14,1:57:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,希特勒点燃可燃烧千年的火焰{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hitler lit a fire that could have burned 1, 000 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:41.14,1:57:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看见每个错误{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw every mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:43.23,1:57:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个过失{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every blunder.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:44.89,1:57:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会拨乱反正{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will correct them all.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:46.73,1:57:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,历史就是一长串失败 琼斯博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}History is a long list of losses, Dr. Jones.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:50.40,1:57:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题就在谁犯错{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a question of whose.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:04.33,1:58:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,停{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:18.49,1:59:19.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰迪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.20,1:59:22.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会开那种飞机吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you can fly one of those?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:24.37,1:59:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,北方运输机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A Nord?
Dialogue: 0,1:59:27.91,1:59:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:29.62,1:59:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好像不太确定{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a ringing response.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:31.08,1:59:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没开过北方飞机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I haven't flown a Nord.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:32.71,1:59:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么飞机都没开过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've never flown any plane.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:35.96,1:59:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去发动它{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get it started.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:37.21,1:59:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 泰迪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Teddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:40.05,1:59:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,完蛋{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crap.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:08.33,2:00:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,系好安全带 琼斯博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fasten your seat belt, Dr. Jones.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:09.75,2:00:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能会有乱流{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There might be some turbulence.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:12.29,2:00:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是德国人 佛勒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're German, Voller.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:15.04,2:00:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,没必要搞笑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't try and be funny.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:40.32,2:00:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 吹牛大王{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, big talker.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:57.13,2:00:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:14.81,2:01:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:16.56,2:01:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,数据正常 马力满档{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gauges green. Power full.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:19.86,2:01:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,时速达到85英里就仰转{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when I reach 85, I rotate.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:00.02,2:02:01.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下襟翼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, wings down.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:03.69,2:02:05.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 时速84英里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, 84 miles an hour.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:05.99,2:02:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,仰转{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rotate.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:14.89,2:03:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,抵达目的地时间{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to destination?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:17.39,2:03:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,60秒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}60 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:24.27,2:03:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,大陆漂移{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Continental drift.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:29.15,2:03:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,大陆漂移{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Continental drift!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:32.12,2:03:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿基米德不懂大陆漂移{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Archimedes didn't know about continental drift.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:35.41,2:03:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He couldn't have!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:37.58,2:03:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时还没人观察到{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It hadn't been observed yet.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:40.71,2:03:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你偏离目标了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're off target.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:42.96,2:03:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你座标所根据的地点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your coordinates are based on markers…
Dialogue: 0,2:03:45.71,2:03:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经移动了两千年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}that have been moving for 2000 years!
Dialogue: 0,2:03:48.97,2:03:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能偏离10度{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could be off by 10 degrees, by…
Dialogue: 0,2:04:07.36,2:04:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,30秒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:10.20,2:04:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,佛勒先生{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Herr Voller…
Dialogue: 0,2:04:11.20,2:04:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你算错了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your calculations are wrong!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:14.49,2:04:15.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 佛勒先生 - 可以闭嘴吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Herr Voller… - Will you shut up?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:16.33,2:04:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在思考{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:20.29,2:04:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,20秒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}20 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:23.79,2:04:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,维持航线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold the flight path!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:27.09,2:04:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,15秒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}15 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:32.05,2:04:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道我们要去哪 尤根{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know where we're going, Jürgen.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:33.64,2:04:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,10秒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}10 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:35.05,2:04:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,9秒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}9!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:36.05,2:04:36.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在绝对…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it sure as hell…
Dialogue: 0,2:04:37.06,2:04:37.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,8秒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}8!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:37.97,2:04:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,7秒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}7!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:38.93,2:04:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是1939年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}…ain't 1939!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:39.85,2:04:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,6秒{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}6!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:40.77,2:04:41.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,调头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn around!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:42.31,2:04:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,中止{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abort!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:43.94,2:04:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,调头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn around!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:45.65,2:04:46.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,中止{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}ABORT!!!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:46.77,2:04:48.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被拉进去了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're being pulled in!
Dialogue: 0,2:04:58.66,2:05:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:00.29,2:05:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的飞机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my plane!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:01.46,2:05:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在开我的飞机{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're flying my plane!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:27.52,2:05:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们死定了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to DIE!!!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:29.90,2:05:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快拉升{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to pull up!
Dialogue: 0,2:05:53.67,2:05:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,重启引擎{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Restart engines!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:23.62,2:06:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是西西里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Sicily.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:24.71,2:06:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,1939年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}1939.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:27.75,2:06:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我成功了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did it.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:29.33,2:06:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我成功了 琼斯博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did it, Dr. Jones!
Dialogue: 0,2:06:31.04,2:06:32.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,前往慕尼黑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Setting coordinates for Munich.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:39.64,2:06:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天属于我们 琼斯博士{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yesterday belongs to us, Dr. Jones.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:06.62,2:07:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些是罗马三列桨座战船{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are Roman triremes.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:37.15,2:07:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续飞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it in the air!
Dialogue: 0,2:07:58.17,2:07:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master…
Dialogue: 0,2:07:59.34,2:08:01.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗马人接近了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Romans are getting closer.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:03.51,2:08:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有飞龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have dragons!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:09.10,2:08:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,太惊人了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:19.95,2:08:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the door!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:25.87,2:08:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们做什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:28.04,2:08:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们干嘛 白痴{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing, you idiots?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:29.71,2:08:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们以为我们是怪兽{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They think we're a monster!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:37.96,2:08:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得调头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to turn around.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:39.63,2:08:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是叙拉古围城{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the Siege of Syracuse.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:42.68,2:08:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,公元前214年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}214 BC.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:43.89,2:08:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你进入错误的战场{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got the wrong war.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:48.93,2:08:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master…
Dialogue: 0,2:08:53.40,2:08:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,别出去 主人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't ride out there, Master!
Dialogue: 0,2:08:55.23,2:08:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The dragons!!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:06.70,2:09:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得射下他们的飞龙{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must take down their dragons!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:17.21,2:09:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,老大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boss!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:18.30,2:09:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,改变航线{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Change course!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:19.46,2:09:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,入口几分钟后就关闭{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The portal closes in minutes!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:21.26,2:09:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go back!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:22.72,2:09:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能留在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't be here!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:23.97,2:09:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能留在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I CAN'T STAY HERE!!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:25.22,2:09:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞机赶不过去的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}The plane won't make it!!
Dialogue: 0,2:09:56.54,2:09:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:03.72,2:10:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样 野蛮人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you like that, you savages?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:08.89,2:10:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 老兄 你是纳粹{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, pal, but you're a Nazi!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:21.69,2:10:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:23.94,2:10:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来救你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rescuing you!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:37.00,2:10:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他打下去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him off!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:39.50,2:10:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indy!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:46.01,2:10:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,降落伞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parachute!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:50.14,2:10:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有降落伞{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a parachute!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:52.68,2:10:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,2:10:57.31,2:10:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,放手{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:00.61,2:11:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,降落伞给我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the parachute!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:07.99,2:11:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住 抓好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab it. Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:12.33,2:11:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indy!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:40.77,2:11:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开始下坠了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're losing altitude!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:43.48,2:11:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,往下掉了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going down!
Dialogue: 0,2:11:46.32,2:11:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我控制不住了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've lost control!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:06.13,2:12:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些是我的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, those are my friends.
Dialogue: 0,2:12:09.01,2:12:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些是我的朋友 我们得救他们{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are my friends. We need to help them!
Dialogue: 0,2:12:11.97,2:12:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些是我的朋友{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are my friends!
Dialogue: 0,2:13:15.45,2:13:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eureka.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:34.01,2:13:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想降落{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's trying to land.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:35.05,2:13:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来 印第 帮帮我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Indy. Help me.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:37.60,2:13:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来 对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:39.77,2:13:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,带你离开这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get you out of here. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:44.23,2:13:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮个忙 坐起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me. Sit up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,2:13:46.40,2:13:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来 你得帮我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit up. You need to help me.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:47.94,2:13:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道很痛 但我得带你回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it hurts, but we gotta get you back.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:49.86,2:13:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,太不可思议了 袋熊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is incredible, Wombat.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:53.11,2:13:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可思议{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incredible.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:56.62,2:13:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it very well is.
Dialogue: 0,2:13:58.49,2:14:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得带你离开{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we have to get you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:02.20,2:14:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:05.00,2:14:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们见证了历史{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're witnessing history.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:14.13,2:14:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,翻转这些数字{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reverse these numbers.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:15.93,2:14:17.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们会带你回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll get you home.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:18.85,2:14:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:22.60,2:14:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要留下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to stay.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:24.73,2:14:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 你乱讲{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You're not serious.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:29.40,2:14:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是认真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, you are serious.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:34.53,2:14:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第 你中弹了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indy, you've been shot.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:36.41,2:14:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在流血{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:37.70,2:14:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能待在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't stay here.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:39.37,2:14:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I can.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:40.91,2:14:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But for what?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:41.95,2:14:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,用膏药和水蛭 慢慢痛死吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a long, painful death with poultice and leeches?
Dialogue: 0,2:14:46.62,2:14:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想象过这种情况 袋熊{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've imagined this, Wombat.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:49.84,2:14:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我研究过{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Studied it.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:51.84,2:14:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 研究了一辈子 - 是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All my life. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:54.05,2:14:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果留下 你会把它毁于一旦{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you stay here, you will muck it all up.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:57.30,2:14:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且会没命{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And die.
Dialogue: 0,2:14:58.89,2:15:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你 起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, get up.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:02.26,2:15:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,海伦娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helena!
Dialogue: 0,2:15:03.85,2:15:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我成功了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did it!
Dialogue: 0,2:15:04.93,2:15:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,太赞了 泰迪 为你欢呼{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bravo, Teddy! Three cheers!
Dialogue: 0,2:15:07.44,2:15:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第 该走了 起来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Indy, we've gotta go. Get up.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:09.15,2:15:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我带你上飞机 - 不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I need to get you into that plane, okay? - No.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:10.77,2:15:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 非去不可 - 不要{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We need to. - No.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:11.82,2:15:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来 你可以…我们可以{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up. You can… We can!
Dialogue: 0,2:15:26.37,2:15:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,主人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Master!
Dialogue: 0,2:15:30.21,2:15:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该离开了 主人{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to leave, Master.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:33.59,2:15:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's him.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:43.56,2:15:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他问我们穿越了多久{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's asking how far we've come.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:49.06,2:15:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,两千年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two thousand years.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:52.40,2:15:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've come…
Dialogue: 0,2:15:54.15,2:15:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,穿越了两千年{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}two thousand years.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:59.49,2:16:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们没料到会遇见…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we didn't expect to meet…
Dialogue: 0,2:16:03.16,2:16:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟大的…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}the great…
Dialogue: 0,2:16:06.20,2:16:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿基米德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Archimedes.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:13.92,2:16:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…
Dialogue: 0,2:16:16.05,2:16:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,本来…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}were always…
Dialogue: 0,2:16:18.05,2:16:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}going to…
Dialogue: 0,2:16:20.01,2:16:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到我{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}meet me.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:22.39,2:16:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个轮盘就像道具扑克牌{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That dial is a forced deck.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:24.18,2:16:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,只能带我们来这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't take us anywhere but here.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:25.76,2:16:27.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是做来求助的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He built it to get help.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:27.22,2:16:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚吓跑了整批罗马海军{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we just scared off the entire Roman Navy…
Dialogue: 0,2:16:29.64,2:16:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们帮得够多了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I think we've helped enough.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:31.06,2:16:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 阿基米德{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apologies, Archimedes.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:32.86,2:16:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是你的粉丝{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a fan…
Dialogue: 0,2:16:34.48,2:16:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们该走了 他受伤了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we need to leave. He's hurt.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:36.65,2:16:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,海伦娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helena…
Dialogue: 0,2:16:37.69,2:16:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,轮盘不能让他留着{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't keep that, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:38.69,2:16:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他必须自己做一个{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs to build his own one.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:39.95,2:16:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,海伦娜 我们该走了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helena, we need to go!
Dialogue: 0,2:16:42.16,2:16:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第 窗口快关闭了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indy, the window is closing!
Dialogue: 0,2:16:44.41,2:16:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能困在这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We cannot get stuck here!
Dialogue: 0,2:16:46.87,2:16:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want…
Dialogue: 0,2:16:47.87,2:16:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下来{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}to stay…
Dialogue: 0,2:16:49.33,2:16:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,陪你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}with you.
Dialogue: 0,2:16:51.25,2:16:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行…别答应{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no! Do not say yes!
Dialogue: 0,2:16:53.79,2:16:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很杰出{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a brilliant man…
Dialogue: 0,2:16:56.29,2:16:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是智者{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a wise man…
Dialogue: 0,2:16:58.84,2:17:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,天才{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a genius…
Dialogue: 0,2:17:00.34,2:17:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,海伦娜{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helena…
Dialogue: 0,2:17:01.34,2:17:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,人民心中的英雄{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}a hero to your people.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:04.26,2:17:07.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他帮不了你{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he can't help you.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:09.02,2:17:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的时代{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your time.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:10.89,2:17:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的时代{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your time.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:11.81,2:17:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他得回到自己的时代{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must be in his own time.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:14.10,2:17:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他必须回去{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs to be in his.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:15.40,2:17:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的工作还没结束{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His work is not done.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:16.48,2:17:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他必须回家{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He needs to go home.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:17.61,2:17:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,家里有药{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is medicine at home.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:19.36,2:17:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不能死在这里 不能{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}He cannot die here. He can't.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:22.65,2:17:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,海伦娜 上飞机吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helena, get on the plane.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:28.24,2:17:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be all right.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:31.16,2:17:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,才怪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you won't.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:35.46,2:17:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要这么做{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to do this.
Dialogue: 0,2:17:38.46,2:17:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me too.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:33.93,2:18:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,早{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:39.86,2:18:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,肩膀还好吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's the shoulder?
Dialogue: 0,2:18:43.74,2:18:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,比我的下巴好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better than my jaw.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:49.87,2:18:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:52.87,2:18:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该让我留下的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should've let me stay.
Dialogue: 0,2:18:55.25,2:18:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,没办法{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:05.51,2:19:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,2:19:08.34,2:19:10.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先 你会改变历史进程{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, for starters, you'd have changed the course of history.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:15.23,2:19:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是坏事吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's supposed to be a bad thing?
Dialogue: 0,2:19:21.15,2:19:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本来就该在这里 印第{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're meant to be here, Indy.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:26.82,2:19:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,2:19:32.87,2:19:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了谁{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}For who?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:01.31,2:20:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛莉安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marion.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:04.15,2:20:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:24.55,2:20:25.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰迪{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Teddy.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:27.09,2:20:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛莉安{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marion.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:30.84,2:20:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,2:20:33.35,2:20:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,把买来的东西放好{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Putting groceries away.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:36.85,2:20:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里一点吃的都没有{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}There wasn't a scrap of food in this place.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:40.44,2:20:42.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 说真的{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Really.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:46.98,2:20:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人告诉我你回来了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone told me you were back.
Dialogue: 0,2:20:56.83,2:20:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你回来了吗 印第{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you back, Indy?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:00.16,2:21:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是炸药{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was explosives…
Dialogue: 0,2:21:02.04,2:21:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第在跑 玛莉安也在跑{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Indy was running, Marion was running…
Dialogue: 0,2:21:04.33,2:21:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着飞机突然爆炸{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}and suddenly the plane exploded.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:10.67,2:21:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,印第 你醒了{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indy, you're up and about.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:13.97,2:21:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:16.47,2:21:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,对{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:18.31,2:21:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,小朋友 我们去吃冰淇淋吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we go and get some ice cream, kids?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:20.39,2:21:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛莉安刚刚有买{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Marion just bought some.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:21.73,2:21:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道一个更棒的地方{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I know a better place.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:23.10,2:21:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,冰淇淋不嫌多 对吧{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can never have too much ice cream, can you?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:29.07,2:21:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,回头见{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you later.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:33.11,2:21:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国水手志向远大{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}A British tar is a soaring soul.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:36.58,2:21:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,如山鸟般自由{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}As free as a mountain bird.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:39.58,2:21:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他强有力的拳头{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}His energetic fist.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:41.58,2:21:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该准备抵抗…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should be ready to resist…
Dialogue: 0,2:21:45.88,2:21:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来好严重{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}That looks bad.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:48.67,2:21:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,会痛吗{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it hurt?
Dialogue: 0,2:21:52.72,2:21:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,从头痛到脚{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything hurts.
Dialogue: 0,2:21:56.80,2:21:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这种感觉{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how that feels.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:04.48,2:22:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,有哪里不痛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, where doesn't it hurt?
Dialogue: 0,2:22:15.32,2:22:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:17.53,2:22:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里不痛{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't hurt here.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:27.25,2:22:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有这里{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here.
Dialogue: 0,2:22:52.19,2:22:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,贾巴利 艾莉亚 慢一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jabari, Alia, slow down!
Dialogue: 0,2:22:54.74,2:22:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,海伦娜 快点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Helena! Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,2:22:57.20,2:22:59.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尖叫 你尖叫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}I scream, you scream…
Dialogue: 0,2:22:59.87,2:23:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家慢一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody, slow down.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:01.70,2:23:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我尖叫 你尖叫 - 我尖叫…{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I scream, you scream - I scream, I scream.
Dialogue: 0,2:23:04.33,2:23:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都为冰淇淋尖叫{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all scream for ice cream!
Dialogue: 0,2:23:06.21,2:23:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢一点{\r}\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slow down.
